�1��id�161748748124�body�ٍ启蒙思想家以理性、个人权利与社会契约为依据挑战神权与王权，为民主、世俗国家与宪政奠定思想基础。ٳEnlightenment thinkers used reason, individual rights, and the social contract to challenge divine and royal authority, laying foundations for democracy and constitutional states.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�178c132bf761�body���同样的事实用不同方式表述（如“存活90%”对比“死亡10%”）会引导出不同决定，说明偏好并非固定，而受表述语境影响；这对医疗、营销和政策设计都有意义。��The same facts presented differently (e.g., “90% survive” vs. “10% die”) lead to different choices, showing preferences aren't fixed but context-dependent—relevant to medicine, marketing, and policy design.�ans��src��6丹尼尔·卡尼曼《思考，快与慢》（2011）�5Daniel Kahneman, “Thinking, Fast and Slow” (2011)��id�17a035e29480�body���皮凯蒂在《21世纪资本论》中指出，当资本收益率（r）长期高于经济增长率（g），财富向存量资本集中，劳动与教育的回报相对被削弱。他主张全球累进资本税以遏制世袭式不平等。� In Capital in the Twenty-First Century, Piketty argues that when the return on capital persistently exceeds growth, wealth concentrates in existing capital, weakening the relative rewards of labor and education. He proposes a global progressive capital tax to curb patrimonial inequality.�ans��src��7Piketty,《Capital in the Twenty-First Century》(2014)�:Thomas Piketty, Capital in the Twenty-First Century (2014)��id�17a09c343391�body��泰勒（Tom Tyler）的研究表明，人们是否服从法律更多取决于程序是否公正（被尊重、有发言权），而非结果是否对自己有利。可感知的公平程序提升自愿守法与长期制度信任，即便个体在单次结果中受损。�"Tom Tyler's research shows compliance depends more on whether procedures are fair, being treated with respect and given a voice, than on favorable outcomes. Perceived fair process builds voluntary compliance and long-term institutional trust even when an individual loses a particular case.�ans��src��)Tyler,《Why People Obey the Law》(2006)�)Tom Tyler, Why People Obey the Law (2006)��id�17c47b58862e�body���偏见多源于有偏的训练数据、被放大的历史歧视、目标函数只优化点击等窄指标，以及设计者的隐含假设；它并不“中立”，需审计与多样数据来纠正。��Bias often comes from skewed training data, amplified historical discrimination, narrow goals like click optimization, and designers' hidden assumptions; it isn't “neutral” and needs auditing and diverse data to correct.�ans��src��OBarocas & Selbst,《Big Data's Disparate Impact》(California Law Review, 2016)�ZSolon Barocas & Andrew Selbst, 'Big Data's Disparate Impact' (California Law Review, 2016)��id�19af6d10e5d2�body���数据具有非竞争性（可被多方同时使用）、来源外部性（他人的数据可用于推断我）与信息不对称（用户不知被收集什么、流向何处），价格机制难以把隐私损害内部化，形成“数据市场失灵”。GDPR通过知情同意、目的限制、删除权与罚款机制试图重置权力关系；实证发现它确实提高了透明度并赋予用户实质权利，但也带来合规成本上升、中小平台负担更重、同意疲劳（用户机械点击“同意”），以及部分数据处理向监管更宽松地区转移等副作用。评估结论是：隐私监管真实改变了行为，但成本与分配后果远比“保护用户”这一口号复杂。�6Data is non-rival (usable by many at once), subject to source externalities (others' data can be used to infer things about me), and plagued by information asymmetry (users don't know what is collected or where it flows), so prices can't internalize privacy harm—data market failure. The GDPR tries to reset power through informed consent, purpose limitation, the right to erasure, and fines. Evidence shows it genuinely raised transparency and gave users real rights, but also brought compliance costs that hit smaller platforms harder, consent fatigue (mechanical clicking of “agree”), and some reallocation of data processing to less-regulated jurisdictions. The assessment: privacy regulation changes behavior, but its costs and distributional effects are far more complex than the slogan “protecting users.”�ans��src��9欧盟委员会《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR, 2018)�DEuropean Commission, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, 2018)��id�1c1925226d6d�body���贝弗里奇模式以「男性养家」为隐性前提，将照护视为家庭私务，公共供给不足。女性主义福利研究指出这使女性被锁定于无酬照护，限制其劳动参与。��The Beveridge model implicitly assumes a male breadwinner and treats care as a private family matter, under-providing public care. Feminist welfare scholarship shows this locks women into unpaid care and limits their labour-force participation.�ans��src��TEsping-Andersen, G. (1990), 《福利资本主义的三个世界》, 政治出版社�PEsping-Andersen, G. (1990), The Three Worlds of Welfare Capitalism, Polity Press��id�1d34a8d9fd3b�body�٫克鲁格曼等指出规模经济与运输成本下降（向心力）促集聚，而拥挤成本与地价（离心力）促分散，二者均衡决定产业空间分布。ٿKrugman et al. show scale economies and falling transport costs (centripetal) drive clustering, while congestion and land rents (centrifugal) disperse; their balance sets the spatial pattern.�ans��src��oFujita, Krugman & Venables,《The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade》(MIT Press, 1999)�kFujita, Krugman & Venables, The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade (MIT Press, 1999)��id�1e33f0e809b2�body�� 两人利用新泽西提高最低工资、相邻的宾夕法尼亚未变的「自然实验」，对比了两地快餐店雇佣变化。结果发现新泽西就业不降反略升，质疑了简单供需模型，并推动了差分中的差分（DID）方法在劳动经济学中的普及。�OUsing the natural experiment of New Jersey raising its minimum wage while neighbouring Pennsylvania did not, they compared hiring at fast-food restaurants. Employment in New Jersey rose slightly rather than falling, contesting the simple supply-demand model and popularising difference-in-differences (DID) methods in labour economics.�ans��src��sCard, D. & Krueger, A. (1994), 《最低工资与就业：快餐业案例研究》, 美国经济评论 (AER), 84(4)لCard, D. & Krueger, A. (1994), Minimum Wages and Employment: A Case Study of the Fast-Food Industry, American Economic Review, 84(4)��id�20ddb6f21bab�body���卡尼曼在 2011 年提出人类思维有双系统：系统1快速、直觉、自动化（如认脸），系统2缓慢、理性、需努力（如心算）。许多认知偏差来自系统1的快捷启发式替代了系统2的审慎思考。�&In 2011 Kahneman described two mental systems: System 1 is fast, intuitive, and automatic (e.g., face recognition), while System 2 is slow, deliberate, and effortful (e.g., mental arithmetic). Many cognitive biases arise when System 1’s heuristics substitute for System 2’s careful thought.�ans��src��6丹尼尔·卡尼曼《思考，快与慢》（2011）�5Daniel Kahneman, “Thinking, Fast and Slow” (2011)��id�22204dfdb599�body��科尔与沃特金斯在 1986 年总结，一个社会的生育率要下降，须同时满足：夫妻有「控制生育」的意愿、知道并掌握可行方法、且认为少生「利大于弊」。该框架解释了为何现代化未必自动带来低生育。�"Coale and Watkins argued in 1986 that a society's fertility falls only when three conditions hold: couples want to limit births, know and can use feasible methods, and see fewer children as advantageous. The framework explains why modernization does not automatically produce low fertility.�ans��src��6Coale & Watkins，《欧洲生育率的下降》(1986)�<Coale & Watkins, 'The Decline of Fertility in Europe' (1986)��id�22960cbffdc4�body�ٽ议程设置理论指媒体虽难决定你怎么想，却能通过报道量决定你想什么——高频议题会被公众视为重要。它揭示注意力也是一种被分配的资源。��Agenda-setting theory holds media rarely tell you how to think, but through coverage volume tell you what to think about—frequent topics seem important. It reveals attention as an allocated resource.�ans��src��gRobert Entman,《Framing: Toward Clarification of a Fractured Paradigm》,Journal of Communication,1993�8R. M. Entman, Framing, Journal of Communication 43, 1993��id�22b5fa9c3d8a�body���黏性价格指价格对供需变化反应迟缓，因菜单成本、合同与习惯难以即时调整。它解释为何货币政策短期能影响产出而非仅改变价格。新凯恩斯主义将其作为市场不完全的核心假设。��Sticky prices adjust slowly to supply-demand shifts due to menu costs, contracts, and habits. They explain why monetary policy affects output in the short run rather than only prices. New Keynesianism makes this the core assumption of market imperfection.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�23b32f1fc700�body���奥克斯卡-布林德分解将工资差距拆为可观测特征（教育、经验）贡献与残差（常归因于歧视或不可观测因素）。OECD 就业展望据此报告多数成员国差距中相当部分仍属未解释。�*The Oaxaca-Blinder decomposition splits the wage gap into a part explained by observable characteristics (education, experience) and a residual often attributed to discrimination or unobservables. OECD Employment Outlook reports that a substantial share remains unexplained across member countries.�ans��src��2OECD (2019), 《就业展望 2019》, 经合组织�)OECD (2019), OECD Employment Outlook 2019��id�2427447afc98�body��8马克思以生产资料的占有关系界定阶级，强调资本家与工人阶级的对立；韦伯则提出阶级（经济）、地位群体（声望）与政党（权力）三维分层。两者都解释不平等，但韦伯更强调多元分层标准。这些理论仍是分析社会分层的基础框架。�jMarx defined class by relationship to the means of production, stressing the opposition of capitalists and workers; Weber proposed a three-dimensional stratification of class (economic), status group (prestige), and party (power). Both explain inequality, but Weber emphasizes multiple criteria. These remain foundational frameworks for analyzing stratification.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�26409ef8caae�body��集聚经济来自共享中间品、劳动力池与知识溢出，使生产率随城市规模上升；集聚不经济来自拥堵、地价与污染等成本。当边际不经济超过边际集聚收益时，城市规模收益递减甚至转为负值，出现「集聚阴影」。�KAgglomeration economies from shared inputs, labor pooling, and knowledge spillovers raise productivity with city size, while diseconomies arise from congestion, land prices, and pollution. When marginal diseconomies exceed marginal agglomeration benefits, scale returns diminish or turn negative, producing an agglomeration shadow.�ans��src��oFujita, Krugman & Venables,《The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade》(MIT Press, 1999)�kFujita, Krugman & Venables, The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade (MIT Press, 1999)��id�26e9b3ca602a�body���国际法院（ICJ）是联合国的主要司法机关，位于海牙，受理国家之间的法律争端并就联合国机构提交的法律问题发表咨询意见。它不同于审理个人的国际刑事法院（ICC）。��The International Court of Justice (ICJ) is the UN’s principal judicial organ in The Hague, settling legal disputes between states and giving advisory opinions. It differs from the ICC, which tries individuals.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�273a7fe0f258�body���格兰诺维特主张经济行为受具体人际关系与网络结构制约，过度社会化与低度社会化同样失真。他用信任网络解释为什么交易往往依赖私人关系而非纯粹合约。��Granovetter argued economic behavior is constrained by concrete relations and network structure; both over- and under-socialized views mislead. He used trust networks to explain why transactions rely on personal ties, not pure contract.�ans��src��l马克·格兰诺维特《经济行动与社会结构：嵌入问题》(1985, American Journal of Sociology)�{Mark Granovetter, 'Economic Action and Social Structure: The Problem of Embeddedness' (1985), American Journal of Sociology��id�273dfab4acdd�body���威权政体指权力高度集中于少数精英或一人、政治竞争与公民自由受到系统性限制的政治体制，与民主政体相对。其维持依赖强制、意识形态或绩效合法性。��An authoritarian regime concentrates power in a few elites or one leader and systematically limits political competition and civil liberties, in contrast to democracy. It rests on coercion, ideology, or performance legitimacy.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2790de299c59�body���奥托尔的任务模型认为技术既替代常规任务、又互补非常规认知任务，因此长期就业总量未必下降，但岗位结构极化。世界银行 2019 年发展报告进一步指出工作性质变化大于工作消失。�Autor's task model holds that technology both substitutes routine tasks and complements non-routine cognitive ones, so total employment need not fall long term but jobs polarise. The World Bank's 2019 report argues that the nature of work changes more than work disappears.�ans��src�ٖAutor, D. (2015), 《为何仍有这么多工作？》, 经济展望杂志; 世界银行 (2019), 《世界发展报告 2019：工作性质的变革》٤Autor, D. (2015), Why Are There Still So Many Jobs?, Journal of Economic Perspectives; World Bank (2019), World Development Report 2019: The Changing Nature of Work��id�28b5e1ee26a0�body��#自然法主张存在超越实定法的、基于理性或道德的普遍法则，恶法可能不具真正法律效力；法律实证主义则认为法的有效性来自其制定程序与渊源，与道德对错相分离。两者的争论围绕“法律与道德是否必然相连”展开。�KNatural law holds there are universal principles based on reason or morality above enacted law, and unjust laws may lack true legal validity; legal positivism holds a law's validity comes from its enactment process and sources, separate from moral rightness. Their debate centers on whether law and morality are necessarily linked.�ans��src��,H.L.A. 哈特《法律的概念》（1961）�,H.L.A. Hart, “The Concept of Law” (1961)��id�2a7cdce7785e�body���象征互动论是社会学微观视角，强调人们通过符号（语言、姿态）赋予行动意义，并在日常互动中建构自我与社会现实。米德、库利是其重要奠基者。��Symbolic interactionism is a micro-sociological view that people create meaning through symbols—language, gestures—and construct self and social reality in everyday interaction. Mead and Cooley were key founders.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2ac4c82a139c�body���李普塞特提出繁荣-教育-民主的关联，跨国数据确实显示高收入国家更可能维持民主，政治学共识是“经济发展虽不直接导致民主化，却是民主存活的最强预测因子”（“没有国家在贫困中保持民主”的论点）。但批评同样扎实：许多高增长国家长期保持威权（如海湾产油国，资源收入削弱了“国家依赖公民征税”的问责逻辑）；中产阶级崛起是否推动变革，取决于其与政权的利益绑定；反向因果同样存在——民主也可能促进教育投资。近期研究还发现，经济发展的作用更多是降低政变与威权回潮风险，而不是触发转型本身。�`Lipset documented the prosperity-education-democracy correlation; cross-national data indeed show high-income countries are far more likely to sustain democracy, and the field's consensus is that development is the strongest predictor of democratic survival, even if it does not directly cause democratization (the “no nation in poverty stays democratic” argument). But criticisms are solid: many fast-growing countries stayed authoritarian for long periods (e.g., Gulf oil states, where resource revenue weakens the accountability logic of taxing citizens); whether a rising middle class pushes for change depends on its ties to the regime; reverse causality also exists—democracy may boost education investment. Recent research further shows development's role is more about lowering coup and authoritarian-reversal risks than triggering transition itself.�ans��src���Seymour Martin Lipset，“Some Social Requisites of Democracy: Economic Development and Political Legitimacy”，American Political Science Review，1959；Adam Przeworski 等，Democracy and Development，Cambridge University Press，2000。�8Seymour Martin Lipset, "Some Social Requisites of Democracy: Economic Development and Political Legitimacy," American Political Science Review 53(1), 1959; Adam Przeworski et al., Democracy and Development: Political Institutions and Material Well-Being in the World, 1950-1990, Cambridge University Press, 2000.��id�2be3a61ba5df�body��户籍制度将居民登记为农业或非农业户口，并绑定教育、医疗等公共资源，使跨地区迁移者常难平等享受服务。它在计划经济时期严格限制进城，后逐步放宽。改革户籍被视为促进公平流动的关键。�NThe household registration system classifies residents as agricultural or non-agricultural and ties public services like education and health to it, so cross-regional migrants often cannot access benefits equally. It strictly limited city entry in the planned-economy era and later eased. Reforming it is seen as key to fair mobility.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�2cb99295d03e�body��x常用队列要素法，按分年龄的生育、死亡与迁徙假设推算未来规模，结果对假设高度敏感。َThe cohort-component method projects by age-specific fertility, mortality, and migration assumptions; results are highly assumption-sensitive.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�2f493ba7121d�body�� 宋代商业繁荣、铜钱需求大增，但铜料不足且大量铜钱被私铸、销毁或外流，导致市场上铜钱反而紧缺，称为“钱荒”。政府曾试图用纸币和铁钱缓解，却引发新的贬值问题。它反映了货币供给与经济增长之间的紧张。�uThe Song dynasty saw booming commerce and surging demand for copper cash, but copper was short and large amounts were privately minted, melted, or exported, creating an actual shortage known as “qianhuang.” The government tried paper notes and iron coins to ease it, yet triggered new depreciation problems. It reflects tension between money supply and economic growth.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2fe0def3f032�body��D社会流动指个人或家庭在社会阶层中的位置发生变化，比如从低收入移动到高收入。向上流动（阶层上升）和向下流动都存在；也可按代际（父母到子女）或一生内来划分。教育机会、公平性、经济结构和制度都会影响一个社会的流动难易程度。�}Social mobility is the movement of individuals or families from one social position to another—for example, from low income to high income. Both upward and downward mobility exist, and it can be measured across generations (parent to child) or within a single lifetime. Education access, fairness, economic structure, and institutions all shape how easy mobility is in a society.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�32c55b5f46f3�body��S联邦制通常出现在幅员广阔、族群或地区差异大的国家，它把权力在中央和地方之间分配。这样既能保持全国统一市场与国防，又能让各地区按自身情况立法（如教育、税收），减少单一集权引发的矛盾。历史上，联邦制也常是各方妥协、避免分裂的产物。�|Federalism usually appears in large or internally diverse countries that split power between a central government and regional units. This keeps a unified market and defense while letting regions legislate on local matters like education or taxation, reducing conflicts from one-size-fits-all rule. Historically, federal systems also emerged as compromises that prevented breakup.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�330fe3ef4c14�body���刻板印象威胁指当某人担心自己会印证所属群体的负面刻板印象时，焦虑反而拖累其表现，如女生在数学测试前被提醒性别差异。它揭示了环境暗示的力量。��Stereotype threat occurs when fear of confirming a negative stereotype about one’s group undermines performance—for example, women reminded of gender gaps before a math test. It shows the power of situational cues.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3398d9d0f199�body���普特南在 2000 年用大量调查数据指出，美国人参加社团、投票和邻里互助等“社会资本”（即维系社会协作的信任与网络）自 1960 年代起持续下降。他认为这削弱了民主运作和社区凝聚力。�/In 2000 Putnam used extensive survey data to show that American participation in clubs, voting, and neighborly help—forms of “social capital,” the trust and networks that sustain cooperation—declined steadily since the 1960s. He argued this weakens democratic functioning and community cohesion.�ans��src��T罗伯特·帕特南《独自打保龄：美国社区的衰落与复兴》（2000）�)Robert Putnam, “Bowling Alone” (2000)��id�33db8c143574�body��全球公共品具有非排他性与非竞争性，且受益跨越国界，单个国家缺乏出资激励，陷入「各国都想搭便车」的集体困境。由于不存在世界政府强制执行，只能依赖自愿协调与转移支付，导致长期供给不足。�7Global public goods are non-excludable and non-rival, with benefits crossing borders, so no single country has sufficient incentive to pay, and each prefers to free-ride. With no world government to enforce contribution, provision depends on voluntary coordination and transfers, producing chronic under-supply.�ans��src��G世界银行(World Bank)《Providing Global Public Goods》研究报告�0World Bank, Providing Global Public Goods report��id�3457902f5c19�body��西蒙在 1957 年指出，人受信息、时间与认知能力限制，无法算出「最优」解，只能追求「满意」的选择。有限理性推翻了完全理性、无限计算力的古典假设，成为行为经济学与组织决策的理论基石。�\Simon argued in 1957 that people are constrained by information, time, and cognitive limits, so they cannot compute the optimal choice and instead 'satisfice.' Bounded rationality overthrew the classical assumption of fully rational, infinitely calculating agents and became a cornerstone of behavioral economics and organizational decision-making.�ans��src�� Simon，《人类模型》(1957)�Simon, 'Models of Man' (1957)��id�34db20dc9768�body���零工经济指通过平台接短单、灵活就业（如外卖、网约车），自由度高但常缺社保与劳动合同保护。它重新定义了雇佣关系，催生权益保障争议。��The gig economy means short, platform-mediated flexible jobs (delivery, ride-hailing): high freedom but often lacking social insurance and labor contracts. It redefines employment and sparks protection disputes.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�383ee0cf7e7f�body��滕尼斯区分了基于血缘、邻里与友谊的“共同体”（有机、情感纽带）与基于契约、算计的“社会”（机械、理性关联）。这一从传统到现代的类型学为涂尔干、韦伯的现代性论述提供了概念工具。��Tönnies contrasted Gemeinschaft (organic bonds of kinship, neighborhood, friendship) with Gesellschaft (contractual, calculating association). His traditional-to-modern typology supplied conceptual tools for Durkheim and Weber's accounts of modernity.�ans��src��Y斐迪南·滕尼斯《共同体与社会》(1887, 查尔斯·P·卢米斯英译本 1957)�dFerdinand Tönnies, Community and Society (Gemeinschaft und Gesellschaft, 1887; trans. Loomis, 1957)��id�388319db248c�body���博特指出，处于连接两个互不连通群体的「结构洞」位置者，能掌控信息桥接与议价权，获得信息与控制双重收益。这把个人回报归因于网络结构而非单纯关系数量。�Burt argues actors spanning structural holes between otherwise disconnected groups control information brokering and bargaining power, gaining information and control benefits. This attributes individual returns to network structure rather than mere tie count.�ans��src��OBurt, R. (1992), 《结构洞：竞争的社会结构》, 哈佛大学出版社�`Burt, R. (1992), Structural Holes: The Social Structure of Competition, Harvard University Press��id�38aa78612fd1�body���地层学借用地质学原理，通过土层堆积的上下顺序判断遗址年代——下层通常更早、上层较晚。它是考古断代与重建古代人类活动序列的基础方法。��Borrowing from geology, archaeological stratigraphy dates a site by the order of soil layers—lower deposits are usually older. It is the basic method for dating and reconstructing ancient activity sequences.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�3a35004ab609�body���文化资本是社会学家布迪厄提出的概念，指通过教育、家庭熏陶获得的品味、言谈、证书等无形资产，能帮助人在学校和社会中占据优势，从而再生产阶层地位。��Cultural capital, coined by sociologist Pierre Bourdieu, is the intangible assets—tastes, speech, credentials—gained through education and upbringing that give advantages in school and society, helping reproduce class status.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3b04cb558743�body���布劳—邓肯发现父亲的职业与受教育年限通过影响个人教育，间接决定子代职业地位，教育是关键中介。该模型把阶层流动量化为可检验的因果链，开启了地位获得的结构化研究传统。��Blau and Duncan found that father's occupation and education shape a son's occupation mainly through the son's own education, which acts as the key mediator. Quantifying mobility as a testable causal chain launched the status-attainment tradition.�ans��src��-布劳与邓肯《美国职业结构》(1967)�PPeter M. Blau and Otis Dudley Duncan, The American Occupational Structure (1967)��id�3bc5b6ef6bed�body��流动性陷阱指利率已降到近乎零、人们仍宁愿持有现金也不愿投资消费，此时央行再「放水」也难以刺激经济。凯恩斯在 1936 年提出这一概念，后来被用于解释日本「失去的十年」与 2008 年后的低利率困境。�A liquidity trap occurs when rates are near zero yet people still hoard cash instead of spending or investing, so the central bank's easing no longer stimulates the economy. Keynes introduced it in 1936; it later explained Japan's 'lost decade' and post-2008 low-rate stagnation.�ans��src��3Keynes，《就业、利息与货币通论》(1936)�EKeynes, 'The General Theory of Employment, Interest and Money' (1936)��id�3f098ade67b6�body��一方面，教育确实提升人力资本和收入，是普通人改变命运的主要通道。另一方面，教育机会和质量的分配并不平等：家庭背景影响学区、补习、课外投入和视野，优势阶层还能通过名校、人脉和“隐性课程”传递优势。布迪厄用“文化资本”解释这种机制——教育看似机会中立，却常把家庭背景的不平等转化成学业和职业的不平等。因此社会学既强调教育的重要性，也提醒人们看清它的双重面孔。�:Education genuinely raises human capital and income, the main route for ordinary people to change their destiny. Yet access and quality are unequally distributed: family background shapes school districts, tutoring, extracurriculars, and horizons, and privileged families pass on advantages through elite schools, networks, and the hidden curriculum. Bourdieu's cultural capital explains the mechanism: an apparently neutral system converts family inequality into academic and career inequality. Sociology therefore stresses both education's promise and its double face.�ans��src��)《社会学概论》(教育与社会章)�9Introduction to Sociology (education and society chapter)��id�40965090678c�body��*威斯特伐利亚体系源于1648年结束欧洲宗教战争的《威斯特伐利亚和约》，确立了以主权国家为基本单位、互不干涉内政的国际秩序原则。它奠定了现代民族国家体系和国际法的基础。至今主权平等仍是国家间关系的重要准则。�OThe Westphalian system originated from the 1648 Peace of Westphalia ending Europe's religious wars, establishing sovereign states as the basic units with non-interference in internal affairs. It laid the foundations of the modern nation-state system and international law. Sovereign equality remains a key norm in interstate relations.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�41cc818641b0�body��当训练数据本身反映历史上的歧视（如少数族裔获批率偏低），模型会把相关性误当作审批依据，并通过代理变量（如邮编）间接编码受保护特征。缓解需做偏差审计、引入公平约束，并在关键决策保留人工复核。�8When training data reflect historical discrimination, say lower approval rates for minorities, the model learns proxies such as zip code that encode protected attributes and mistakes correlation for approval criteria. Mitigation requires bias audits, fairness constraints, and human review at critical decisions.�ans��src��OBarocas & Selbst,《Big Data's Disparate Impact》(California Law Review, 2016)�ZSolon Barocas & Andrew Selbst, 'Big Data's Disparate Impact' (California Law Review, 2016)��id�41fc17902053�body���奥尔森指出个人从公共物品中分得的收益相对于行动成本微不足道，理性个体倾向搭便车，导致大集团失灵。他主张用私人的奖励或惩罚（选择性激励）来驱动参与。��Olson noted that an individual's share of a public good is negligible versus the cost of acting, so rational members free-ride, causing large-group failure. He proposed private rewards or punishments—selective incentives—to motivate participation.�ans��src��5曼瑟尔·奥尔森《集体行动的逻辑》(1965)�3Mancur Olson, The Logic of Collective Action (1965)��id�424ebc388f78�body���随机评估发现，单纯的短期课堂式培训对青年就业效果微弱，原因在于青年失业多为“需求侧”问题（岗位不足、经验门槛）与匹配问题，而非单纯技能供给不足；且存在“替代效应”（受训者挤掉未受训者的岗位）与“锁定效应”（参与者减少求职努力）。效果较好的干预包括：工资补贴（直接降低企业雇佣青年的成本）、在职培训与学徒制（雇主参与、学用结合）、信息与求职辅导，以及针对NEET风险群体的早期密集干预。政策研究者据此主张用需求侧加工作现场培训的组合替代单纯的课堂供给。��Randomized evaluations find that short classroom-based training has weak effects on youth employment, because youth joblessness is largely a demand-side (too few jobs, experience thresholds) and matching problem rather than a pure skills-supply one; substitution effects (trainees displacing untrained workers) and lock-in effects (participants searching less) also blunt results. Interventions that fare better include wage subsidies (directly lowering employer costs of hiring youth), on-the-job training and apprenticeships (employer involvement, learn-by-doing), information and job-search counseling, and early intensive support for those at NEET risk. The policy lesson is to replace pure classroom supply with demand-side plus workplace-based packages.�ans��src��.World Bank（《实践中的影响评估》）�*World Bank (Impact Evaluation in Practice)��id�42a2090cfab9�body���城市群是若干相邻、经济联系紧密并共享基础设施的城市组成的集合体，如长三角、珠三角。它突破单一城市边界，形成分工协作的区域网络。城市群已成为国家参与全球竞争的重要空间单元。�5A city cluster is a group of neighboring cities with close economic ties and shared infrastructure, such as the Yangtze Delta or Pearl River Delta. It breaks single-city boundaries to form a regionally networked division of labor. City clusters have become key spatial units for national competition globally.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�43ecc92d6b53�body���外交豁免指驻外外交人员及其家属在驻在国享有不受刑事和大部分民事管辖的特权，源于《维也纳外交关系公约》。它保障外交沟通顺畅，但也可能被滥用。��Diplomatic immunity grants foreign diplomats and families exemption from the host country’s criminal and most civil jurisdiction, per the Vienna Convention on Diplomatic Relations. It protects communication but can be abused.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�44e7c80da8dc�body���奥斯特罗姆通过多地案例证明社区能在明确边界、本地规则、监督与渐进制裁下长期可持续管理公共资源。她归纳出八项设计原则，说明去中心化治理同样有效。��Ostrom showed through field cases that communities sustain common-pool resources via clear boundaries, local rules, monitoring, and graduated sanctions. Her eight design principles demonstrate that decentralized governance can work.�ans��src��P埃莉诺·奥斯特罗姆《治理公地：集体行动制度的演进》(1990)�`Elinor Ostrom, Governing the Commons: The Evolution of Institutions for Collective Action (1990)��id�455367b9920d�body���核心-边缘理论描述经济活动中，少数“核心”地区（如大城市、沿海）因集聚效应而繁荣，广大“边缘”地区则相对滞后并被抽取资源。它常用于解释区域不平衡发展。��Core-periphery theory describes how a few “core” areas—big cities, coasts—thrive through agglomeration while “peripheral” regions lag and supply them resources. It explains uneven regional development.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�48a97be6611c�body���不一定。扩招提高整体学历，但当高学历变普遍，其“信号”贬值，优势阶层更能把新文凭转化为岗位，弱势者未必获益，甚至加剧“学历通胀”下的相对劣势。�Not necessarily. Expansion raises average credentials, but as degrees become common their signal weakens; advantaged groups convert new credentials into jobs more easily, while the disadvantaged may face worsening relative standing via “credential inflation.”�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�48ed1afaec9f�body�ٍ福利国家指政府通过税收大规模提供医疗、教育、失业和养老等保障，以降低不平等、保障公民基本生活。٤A welfare state is where government uses taxation to broadly provide healthcare, education, unemployment, and pensions to reduce inequality and secure basic living.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�49dbea824fa3�body���卡德利用 1980 年「马里尔小船」自然实验发现迈阿密低技能本土工资未受显著冲击。多数准实验研究显示移民对本土工资的短期影响很小，长期取决于互补性。�Card used the 1980 Mariel boatlift natural experiment and found no significant hit to Miami's low-skilled native wages. Most quasi-experimental studies find immigrants' short-run wage impact on natives is small, with the long run depending on complementarity.�ans��src��nCard, D. (1990), 《马里尔难民潮对迈阿密劳动力市场的影响》, 美国经济评论 (AER), 80(2)�mCard, D. (1990), The Impact of the Mariel Boatlift on the Miami Labor Market, American Economic Review, 80(2)��id�4a2306986b1a�body�ي考古断代用碳-14测年、地层叠压关系等方法确定遗迹或器物的年代，帮助把发现物放进正确的时间顺序。٥Archaeological dating uses methods like carbon-14 radiocarbon dating and stratigraphy to determine the age of finds, placing them in the correct chronological order.�ans��src��n《Radiocarbon Dating an Archaeological Perspective》,Elsevier,1987 (DOI: 10.1016/b978-0-126-84860-1.x5001-6)�k'Radiocarbon Dating an Archaeological Perspective', Elsevier, 1987, DOI: 10.1016/b978-0-126-84860-1.x5001-6��id�4a6413361018�body���制度经济学把法律、产权与规则视为降低交易成本、界定激励的关键安排。它认为清晰且可执行的产权能促使人们投资与交换，从而推动增长。诺贝尔奖得主诺斯强调“制度决定绩效”。�7Institutional economics treats law, property rights, and rules as key arrangements that lower transaction costs and shape incentives. It argues that clear, enforceable property rights encourage investment and exchange, driving growth. Nobel laureate North stressed that “institutions determine performance.”�ans��src��iLa Porta, Lopez-de-Silanes, Shleifer & Vishny,《Law and Finance》(Journal of Financial Economics, 1998)�gLa Porta, Lopez-de-Silanes, Shleifer & Vishny, 'Law and Finance' (Journal of Financial Economics, 1998)��id�4a9edf2b3ef6�body�ٮ地缘政治研究地理位置、自然资源和领土等因素如何影响国家间的权力关系与战略决策，比如沿海位置或能源分布会左右外交政策。��Geopolitics studies how geography, natural resources, and territory shape power relations and strategic decisions among states, such as how coastlines or energy supplies influence foreign policy.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4b1de387d3f2�body�ٯ仪式感通过重复性行为标记时间、凝聚认同与情感，强化“我们是一家人/一个群体”的归属感。它也是代际文化传承的低成本载体。��Ritual sense marks time and binds identity and emotion through repetition, strengthening “we are one family/group” belonging. It is also a low-cost vehicle for intergenerational cultural transmission.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�4c7b83725cc3�body���费斯廷格在 1957 年提出，当人同时持有相互冲突的认知（如“抽烟有害”却“我抽烟”）时会产生心理不适，从而促使其改变态度或行为以减少失调。这一理论是当代社会心理学的基石之一。��In 1957 Festinger proposed that holding conflicting cognitions (e.g., “smoking is harmful” yet “I smoke”) creates discomfort that motivates changing attitudes or behavior to reduce dissonance. It is a cornerstone of modern social psychology.�ans��src��6利昂·费斯廷格《认知失调理论》（1957）�=Leon Festinger, “A Theory of Cognitive Dissonance” (1957)��id�4c9e23382cc9�body�ٍ极端天气与海平面上升迫使部分人口内迁或跨境移动，但多数先在国内短距离迁移，跨境流动受政策限制。َExtreme weather and sea-level rise displace people, yet most move short domestic distances first; cross-border movement is policy-constrained.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�4cc7bede6d07�body���贫民窟主要是城市增长快过制度供给的结果，不是个人选择的产物。人口集中的速度快过住房和管网铺开的速度，正规房源跟不上，只能自建或在他人土地上落脚。产权不清、审批登记门槛高，加盖与出租难合法化，居民缺少改善住所的动力；岗位集中在低薪部门，服务常按户籍或产权分配。拆迁不等于消除贫民窟，只要涌入的动力还在，新的聚居还会形成。��Slums come mainly from urban growth outrunning the institutions meant to house it, not from individual choices. People concentrate in cities faster than housing and pipe networks can be laid out, and when the formal market cannot supply enough homes, they build their own or settle on land belonging to others. Unclear title and demanding approval and registration rules keep extensions and rentals informal, which also leaves residents little reason to upgrade a dwelling, while work clusters in low-paid jobs and services are often allocated by household registration or property rights. Clearing a shantytown is not the same as ending a slum: while the forces driving the inflow remain, new informal settlements form again.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4eaad39241f6�body�ٽ阶层固化指代际之间位置难以改变、优势与劣势在家族内传递的现象，常表现为教育、人脉和财富代际累积；它削弱社会流动，引发公平忧虑。��Class rigidity means positions hardly change across generations, with advantage or disadvantage passed within families via education, networks, and wealth—weakening mobility and raising equity concerns.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�508615e71415�body��吉芬商品是价格上升需求量反而增加的罕见商品，出现在极贫群体中：当主食涨价，实际收入骤降，人们被迫放弃肉菜、买更多廉价主食充饥，收入效应压倒替代效应。它违背一般需求定律，是理论上的特例。�KA Giffen good is a rare case where higher price raises quantity demanded, seen among the very poor: when staple food prices rise, real income drops so sharply that people abandon meat and buy more cheap staples, the income effect overpowering the substitution effect. It violates the usual law of demand as a theoretical exception.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�517b634f563c�body���戴维森于 1983 年提出，人们倾向于认为媒介信息对「别人」影响很大、对自己影响很小，这种偏差会影响舆论与行为（如支持审查）。第三人效应揭示了「自我例外」心理如何塑造公共态度。�#Davison proposed in 1983 that people tend to believe media messages strongly affect 'others' but only weakly affect themselves, a bias that can shape opinion and behavior such as supporting censorship. The third-person effect reveals how a 'self-exception' psychology molds public attitudes.�ans��src��1Davison，《传播中的第三人效应》(1983)�:Davison, 'The Third-Person Effect in Communication' (1983)��id�52db374f6eab�body���西美尔认为城市密集的感官刺激与金钱交易的算计性，迫使个体用理智而非情感来过滤过量信息，从而表现为表面冷漠。这一“刺激屏障”概念成为芝加哥学派与城市互动理论的先声。�Simmel held that the overload of metropolitan stimuli and the calculative logic of money lead individuals to shield themselves with intellect rather than emotion, appearing detached. His notion of a 'protective organ' prefigured Chicago-school and interactionist urban theory.�ans��src��h格奥尔格·西美尔《大都市与精神生活》(1903, 收入 Kurt H. Wolff 编《社会学》1950)�rGeorg Simmel, 'The Metropolis and Mental Life' (1903), in Kurt H. Wolff (ed.) The Sociology of Georg Simmel (1950)��id�5304103bf9dc�body���波兰尼提出“双向运动”：自由市场扩张会摧毁土地、劳动与货币等虚构商品，引发社会自我保护（如福利与管制）。他主张经济始终嵌入社会制度，纯自发市场是乌托邦。�Polanyi described a 'double movement': free-market expansion destroys fictitious commodities (land, labor, money), provoking societal self-protection via welfare and regulation. He held that economy is always embedded in institutions; pure self-regulating markets are utopian.�ans��src��M卡尔·波兰尼《大转型：我们时代的政治与经济起源》(1944)�-Karl Polanyi, The Great Transformation (1944)��id�532e9107969d�body�ٖ统一会计准则让不同公司的财务报表可比、真实，投资者和监管者才能正确判断经营状况，防止造假和误导市场。ٲUniform accounting standards make companies' financial reports comparable and truthful, so investors and regulators can judge performance and prevent fraud or misleading markets.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�535a66b5b9c6�body���数字平台因网络效应、数据壁垒和极低的边际成本，容易形成少数巨头主导（赢家通吃）。这引发对反垄断、数据可携带与互操作性的监管讨论。پDigital platforms tend toward winner-take-all dominance due to network effects, data moats, and near-zero marginal cost, raising antitrust debates over data portability and interoperability.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�537d4505f785�body���长寿风险指人比预期活得更久，导致退休储蓄和年金不足以支撑的风险；对家庭是耗尽积蓄，对保险公司与社保则是给付超预期，需更谨慎的精算与储备。��Longevity risk is outliving expected lifespan so savings and annuities fall short—depleting household funds and forcing insurers and social security to pay longer, calling for prudent actuarial reserves.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�550d1836a0bf�body���融入悖论指第二代移民在出生地长大、语言文化更贴近主流，却可能因更高期望与现实落差、歧视感知而比父辈更强烈表达族群认同或不满。这挑战了线性同化假设。�%The integration paradox is that second-generation immigrants, raised in the host country with mainstream language and culture, may express stronger ethnic identity or grievance than parents due to higher expectations and perceived discrimination. It challenges linear assimilation assumptions.�ans��src��8OECD (2018), 《移民融合指标 2018》, 经合组织�5OECD (2018), Indicators of Immigrant Integration 2018��id�55532877c344�body�٭齐普夫定律指出城市人口排序与规模近似成反比（第2大城市约为第1大的一半）。许多国家大致符合，反映集聚与迁移的均衡机制。ٳZipf’s law: a city’s rank times its size is roughly constant (2nd city ≈ half the 1st). Many countries roughly fit it, reflecting equilibrium in agglomeration and migration.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�57284924960f�body��a逆向选择发生在签约前：投保人更了解自身健康，高危者更愿投保，若按平均风险定价，低危者感到吃亏而退出，保费螺旋上升，市场可能萎缩甚至崩溃（“死亡螺旋”）。道德风险发生在签约后：有了保险，患者倾向多用医疗、医生倾向多开检查，推高费用。回应手段包括强制参保（扩大风险池）、社区费率（禁止按个体风险定价）、共付与免赔额（让患者承担部分成本以抑制过度消费），但共付过高又伤害穷人并减少必要诊疗，凸显公平与效率的张力。��Adverse selection occurs before purchase: applicants know their health better, the high-risk are more eager to enroll, and if priced at the average risk, the low-risk drop out, premiums spiral, and the market can shrink or collapse—a “death spiral.” Moral hazard occurs after purchase: with insurance, patients use more care and doctors order more tests, inflating costs. Responses include mandatory enrollment (broadening the risk pool), community rating (banning individual risk pricing), and copays/deductibles (sharing costs to curb overuse)—but high copays hurt the poor and reduce necessary care, highlighting the fairness-efficiency tension.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�57399def28c1�body���贝克尔认为父母在子女数量与对每孩的人力资本投入间权衡。收入上升时，投资质量的边际回报更高，家庭倾向少生优育，从而生育率下降。该框架是人口转型的经济学基础之一。�6Becker argues parents trade off the number of children against investment in each child's human capital. As income rises, the returns to quality investment dominate, so families have fewer children but invest more, lowering fertility. This is a cornerstone of the economic theory of the demographic transition.�ans��src�ٖBecker, G. (1960), 《发达国家中的生育率经济分析》, 载于《发达国家的人口与经济变迁》, 普林斯顿大学出版社 (NBER)�uBecker, G. (1960), An Economic Analysis of Fertility, in Demographic and Economic Change in Developed Countries, NBER��id�5776b3acdb6d�body��韦伯主张社会学应「理解」行动者赋予行为的意义，而非只统计外在行为；研究者要设身处地解释其动机与价值。这一「解释性社会学」路径强调文化与意义，与纯量化的自然科学研究取向形成对照。�JWeber held that sociology must 'understand' (Verstehen) the meaning actors attach to their behavior, not merely count outward acts; the researcher should interpret motives and values from the actor's standpoint. This interpretive approach stresses culture and meaning, contrasting with purely quantitative natural-science methods.�ans��src��3Weber，《社会科学方法论》(1949 英文版)�6Weber, 'The Methodology of the Social Sciences' (1949)��id�57d1fb013dc2�body���福柯描述从公开酷刑转向以监视、规范化裁决与检查实现的“规训”权力，全景敞视监狱使被监视者自我规训。权力被视为生产性、弥散于日常机制，而非仅由国家自上而下压制。��Foucault traces a shift from spectacular torture to 'disciplinary' power via surveillance, normalizing judgment, and examination; the panopticon makes the watched internalize control. Power is productive and capillary, not merely top-down repression.�ans��src��_米歇尔·福柯《规训与惩罚：监狱的诞生》(1975, 艾伦·谢里登英译本 1977)�bMichel Foucault, Discipline and Punish: The Birth of the Prison (1975; trans. Alan Sheridan, 1977)��id�59f8030c5092�body��&唯物主义历史观（历史唯物主义）由马克思提出，认为物质生活的生产方式决定社会结构、政治与精神生活的一般特征。它强调经济基础与上层建筑的互动，并以阶级矛盾解释历史变迁。该理论深刻影响了社会学与政治学。�~The materialist conception of history (historical materialism), proposed by Marx, holds that the mode of material production determines the general character of social structure, politics, and intellectual life. It stresses the interplay of economic base and superstructure and explains historical change through class conflict. It deeply influenced sociology and political science.�ans��src��W马克思 (1859). 《政治经济学批判（序言）》. 马克思、恩格斯全集.�nMarx, K. (1859). A Contribution to the Critique of Political Economy (Preface). Marx & Engels Collected Works.��id�5aeb7ee3b50b�body�ٴ软法指不具强制约束的宣言、准则与建议，虽难强制，却能塑造预期、建立规范、为日后硬法铺路，并在无主权让渡的情况下推动合作。��Soft law—non-binding declarations, guidelines, recommendations—lacks enforcement but shapes expectations, builds norms, paves the way for later treaties, and fosters cooperation without ceding sovereignty.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5bde353502ee�body��萨托利在 1976 年提出以“数量＋意识形态距离”两个维度划分政党体系：从一党制、两党制到多党制，并按各党意识形态接近或极化区分温和与极化多党制。这一分类成为比较政治学分析政党竞争的基础框架。�@Sartori proposed in 1976 a two-dimensional classification of party systems—by number of parties plus ideological distance—from one-party and two-party to multi-party systems, distinguishing moderate from polarized pluralism. It became a foundational framework in comparative politics for analyzing party competition.�ans��src��]乔瓦尼·萨托利《政党与政党体系》（Sartori, Parties and Party Systems, 1976）�8Giovanni Sartori, “Parties and Party Systems” (1976)��id�5c78830db111�body�ٺ减排具全球公共品属性：各国都想“搭便车”享受他人减排成果而不愿承担成本，导致整体努力不足；需通过可核查的协议与惩罚机制缓解。٦Emissions cuts are a global public good; each state free-rides on others’ efforts, yielding under-provision. Verifiable agreements and enforcement help overcome it.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�5ce86b240e52�body��q公立学校主要按学区就近招生，经费多依赖本地房产税，于是高房价社区集中了好学校与高收入家庭，形成“居住选择+学校质量”的循环强化：富裕家庭为学区溢价购房，进一步推高房价、挤出低收入家庭。学校选择政策（教育券、特许学校）旨在让低收入学区家庭“用脚投票”，但实证效果分化：竞争可能改善部分学校绩效，优质学额却常被信息与交通能力更强的家庭占据，可能加剧分层。研究强调真正打破循环要靠跨学区整合、公平拨款与住房去隔离政策的组合。�Public schools admit by catchment area and depend heavily on local property taxes, so high-priced neighborhoods concentrate good schools and affluent families—a self-reinforcing loop of residential choice and school quality: wealthy families pay premiums for good school districts, inflating housing prices and crowding out low-income families. School-choice policies (vouchers, charter schools) aim to let disadvantaged families “vote with their feet,” but evidence is mixed: competition may improve some school performance, yet better-informed and more mobile families capture the best seats, possibly deepening stratification. Research stresses that breaking the loop requires cross-district integration, equitable funding, and housing de-segregation together.�ans��src���Weathers, Sosina,《Separate Remains Unequal: Contemporary Segregation and Racial Disparities in School District Revenue》,American Educational Research Journal,2022 (DOI: 10.3102/00028312221079297)��Weathers, Sosina, 'Separate Remains Unequal: Contemporary Segregation and Racial Disparities in School District Revenue', American Educational Research Journal, 2022, DOI: 10.3102/00028312221079297��id�5d0b6467d0a6�body���普特南区分：结合型资本强化群体内团结但可能排斥外群；桥接型资本连接异质群体、促进资源与信任跨群流动。后者更利于宏观社会信任与跨阶层机会。�Putnam distinguishes bonding capital, which reinforces in-group solidarity but can exclude outsiders, from bridging capital, which connects heterogeneous groups and promotes cross-group resource and trust flow. The latter better supports macro social trust and cross-class opportunity.�ans��src��]Putnam, R. (2000), 《独自打保龄：美国社区的衰落与复兴》, 西蒙与舒斯特�bPutnam, R. (2000), Bowling Alone: The Collapse and Revival of American Community, Simon & Schuster��id�5dde41b27d06�body���传统性别规范将无偿家务与照护默认为女性责任，使女性劳动时间呈「第二班」叠加。OECD 时间利用调查显示即便双职工家庭，女性家务时数仍显著更高。��Traditional gender norms default unpaid domestic and care work to women, creating a 「second shift」 on top of paid work. OECD time-use surveys show that even in dual-earner households, women's housework hours remain significantly higher.�ans��src��2OECD (2019), 《就业展望 2019》, 经合组织�)OECD (2019), OECD Employment Outlook 2019��id�601d9fc382a7�body���强关系（亲友）圈子高度重叠、信息冗余，而弱关系（泛交）桥接不同群体，带来新颖机会与信息。格兰诺维特据此发现多数人通过弱关系而非密友获得工作，弱关系是社交网络的「桥梁」。��Strong ties form redundant, overlapping circles, while weak ties bridge distinct groups and carry novel information. Granovetter found most people get jobs through weak rather than close ties, which act as bridges in networks.�ans��src��dGranovetter,《The Strength of Weak Ties》,American Journal of Sociology,1973 (DOI: 10.1086/225469)�bGranovetter, 'The Strength of Weak Ties', American Journal of Sociology, 1973, DOI: 10.1086/225469��id�61131edeb4cb�body�� 保守主义是一种强调传统、秩序、渐进改革与制度连续性的政治思想，常将社会视为有机整体。伯克在反思法国大革命时系统阐述了其审慎、尊重历史经验的立场。它与自由主义在变革速度与个人自由边界上常存分歧。�cConservatism is a political outlook emphasizing tradition, order, gradual reform, and institutional continuity, often viewing society as an organic whole. Burke systematically articulated its prudent, history-respecting stance in reflecting on the French Revolution. It often differs from liberalism on the pace of change and limits of individual freedom.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�62e958b96bc6�body���社区营造指居民共同参与规划与改善本地生活空间与关系，提升归属感与自治能力。它针对“陌邻社会”中人际关系淡漠、公共参与不足的问题。��Community building means residents jointly plan and improve local spaces and ties, boosting belonging and self-governance. It tackles indifferent “stranger neighborhoods” with weak public participation.�ans��src��6Robert Putnam,《Bowling Alone》Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000��id�645c1391efcd�body���沃勒斯坦认为资本主义世界经济由不平等交换维系：核心抽取边缘的剩余，半边缘起缓冲与中介作用。国家地位由其在分工中的功能位置决定，而非单纯文化或制度差异。��Wallerstein held that the capitalist world-economy is sustained by unequal exchange: the core extracts surplus from the periphery, with the semiperiphery buffering. A state's position in the division of labor, not mere culture, fixes its status.�ans��src��G伊曼努尔·沃勒斯坦《现代世界体系（第一卷）》(1974)�<Immanuel Wallerstein, The Modern World-System, Vol. I (1974)��id�649372013fbc�body���差异交往论认为犯罪行为通过学习与越轨者频繁接触而习得，与阶级无关。萨瑟兰提出“白领犯罪”指体面职业者职务内的违法，反驳了犯罪仅属贫困群体的偏见。�Differential association holds that criminal behavior is learned through frequent contact with deviant definitions, independent of class. Sutherland coined 'white-collar crime' for offenses by respectable professionals, refuting the idea that crime is a lower-class phenomenon.�ans��src��,埃德温·萨瑟兰《白领犯罪》(1949)�.Edwin H. Sutherland, White Collar Crime (1949)��id�64a85b4aa128�body���巴特勒认为性别不是前因于行动的本质，而是通过反复的身体与言语仪式“操演”出来的稳定假象。异性恋矩阵指把生理性别、社会性别与欲望强制绑定为异性恋规范的话语框架。��Butler argued gender is not a prior essence but a repeated stylized performance producing the illusion of stability. The 'heterosexual matrix' is the discursive frame that coercively binds sex, gender, and desire into heterosexual normativity.�ans��src��M朱迪斯·巴特勒《性别麻烦：女性主义与身份的颠覆》(1990)�MJudith Butler, Gender Trouble: Feminism and the Subversion of Identity (1990)��id�64d5d0f77785�body�ِ失范指社会规范弱化、个体在快速变迁中失去行为准则与意义感的状态，涂尔干将其与更高的自杀率相联系。ّAnomie is a state where social norms weaken and individuals lose moral guidance amid rapid change, which Durkheim linked to higher suicide rates.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�64e1e4fa6cf9�body���利率上升意味着借贷更贵：企业和家庭减少借款与投资，买房买车办企业都变难变贵，总需求随之降温，物价上涨的压力随之减小。同时利率升高让储蓄更有吸引力，消费也会被抑制。这就是货币政策的传导机制，央行借此在控通胀与保增长之间权衡。但效果有滞后，加息过猛也可能把经济推向衰退。��Higher rates make borrowing costlier: firms and households borrow and invest less, big purchases become harder and dearer, aggregate demand cools, and price pressure eases. Higher rates also make saving more attractive, dampening consumption. This is the transmission mechanism of monetary policy, used to balance inflation control against growth. Effects lag, and over-tightening can tip the economy into recession.�ans��src��;《经济学原理》(曼昆)（货币与货币政策章）�CPrinciples of Economics (Mankiw), money and monetary policy chapter��id�653b8dfcb4ab�body�ٍ它追问为何近代科学革命未在中国发生，尽管古代中国科技长期领先，涉及制度、经济与社会结构等因素。ٝIt asks why the Scientific Revolution did not arise in China despite its earlier technological lead, implicating institutions, economy, and social structure.�ans��src��TJoseph Needham 著《Science and Civilisation in China》（中国科学技术史）�1Joseph Needham, Science and Civilisation in China��id�693592340cb4�body��坎贝尔等的「密歇根模型」强调稳定的政党认同主导投票；而后期议题投票研究（如 Nie、Verba 与 Petrocik 的《变化的美国选民》）显示随着政党极化，政策立场对投票的影响上升、认同黏性下降。�
Campbell et al.'s Michigan model stressed stable party identification, while later issue-voting research (e.g., Nie, Verba and Petrocik's The Changing American Voter) shows that as parties polarise, policy positions weigh more and identification becomes less sticky.�ans��src�ٝCampbell, A. et al. (1960), 《美国选民》, 威利出版社; Nie, N., Verba, S. & Petrocik, J. (1979), 《变化的美国选民》, 哈佛大学出版社٢Campbell, A. et al. (1960), The American Voter, John Wiley & Sons; Nie, N., Verba, S. & Petrocik, J. (1979), The Changing American Voter, Harvard University Press��id�6a4255ff6a2d�body��赫勒在 1998 年提出，当同一资源被过多所有者各自握有「一票否决」式权利时，任何使用都需全体同意，结果资源被闲置。它与「公地悲剧」相反：不是人人滥用，而是因权利过散而没人能开发。��Heller argued in 1998 that when too many owners each hold a veto-like right over one resource, any use needs everyone's consent, so the resource sits idle. The opposite of the tragedy of the commons, it is underuse caused by fragmented rights.�ans��src��8Heller，《反公地悲剧》，Harvard Law Review 1998�AHeller, 'The Tragedy of the Anticommons,' Harvard Law Review 1998��id�6ad06b629baf�body���行为经济学发现人并不总按理性计算决策，而是深受默认选项、框架和惰性的影响。助推通过优化“选择架构”来引导行为，同时保留选择自由：比如把养老金设为默认参加，参与率会大幅上升，因为多数人懒得主动退出。强制则成本高、易引发抵触。助推顺应人性而非对抗人性，但也有人批评它带有“家长式操纵”，所以好的助推应当透明且允许退出。��Behavioral economics shows people don't always decide rationally; they're swayed by defaults, framing, and inertia. A nudge reshapes the choice architecture to guide behavior while preserving freedom of choice, and automatically enrolling workers in pension plans, for instance, lifts participation sharply because few bother to opt out. Mandates are costlier and breed resistance. Nudges work with human nature, though critics call them paternalistic, so good ones stay transparent and easy to exit.�ans��src��:Harvard Business Review（行为经济学·助推研究）�:Harvard Business Review (behavioral economics and nudging)��id�6b81c8e9cbe0�body�ٷ继嗣规则决定家族身份与财产沿哪条血脉传递。母系社会按母亲一方计算亲属与继承，父系社会则按父亲一方；还有些社会采用双系继嗣。��Descent rules determine how kinship and inheritance pass down. Matrilineal societies trace identity and property through the mother’s line, patrilineal through the father’s; some use bilateral descent.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6bc0362c9894�body���弱关系连接不同社交圈，能带来强关系无法提供的非冗余新信息，因此更利于求职。该命题说明桥梁式联系比亲密纽带更具信息价值，是网络分析的奠基发现之一。��Weak ties bridge otherwise separate circles and carry non-redundant information strong ties lack, aiding job search. The claim shows bridging ties, not intimacy, carry informational value—a founding insight of network analysis.�ans��src��T马克·格兰诺维特《弱关系的力量》(1973, American Journal of Sociology)�SMark Granovetter, 'The Strength of Weak Ties' (1973), American Journal of Sociology��id�6c47565cfb04�body���单一选区多数制倾向放大两大党、不利于小党（杜瓦杰定律）；比例代表则降低门槛、容纳更多政党，但可能使组阁更分散；混合制介于两者之间。��Single-seat plurality tends to favor two big parties and penalize small ones (Duverger's law); proportional representation lowers barriers and admits more parties but can fragment coalitions; mixed systems sit in between.�ans��src��PRein Taagepera & Matthew Shugart,《Seats and Votes》Yale University Press,1989�LR. Taagepera and M. S. Shugart, Seats and Votes, Yale University Press, 1989��id�6db8d29291a9�body���恶性通胀（月率超50%）多源于政府财政失控、靠印钞还债，叠加民众对货币失去信任的“预期螺旋”。一战后的德国与津巴布韦是典型案例。恢复需财政整顿与独立央行重建信任。�9Hyperinflation (monthly rate above 50%) mostly stems from runaway fiscal deficits financed by printing money, plus an “expectation spiral” as public trust in the currency collapses. Post-WWI Germany and Zimbabwe are classic cases. Recovery needs fiscal repair and an independent central bank to rebuild trust.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6f112edc7024�body�ٮ指城市以中心向外无序连绵蔓延，摊大饼式扩张拉长通勤、占用耕地、削弱公共交通效率。紧凑多中心规划被视为更可持续的替代。��It means cities spread outward from the center in continuous, disorderly sprawl, lengthening commutes, eating farmland, and weakening transit efficiency. Compact, multi-center planning is the greener alternative.�ans��src��oFujita, Krugman & Venables,《The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade》(MIT Press, 1999)�kFujita, Krugman & Venables, The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade (MIT Press, 1999)��id�6f416496d3b6�body���区块链以去中心化、不可篡改的账本记录交易，可在缺乏中央权威时建立可信协作（如跨境支付、供应链溯源），但存在能耗、吞吐量与监管不确定性。��Blockchain uses a decentralized, tamper-resistant ledger to enable trust without central authority (cross-border payments, supply-chain traceability), yet faces energy, throughput, and regulatory uncertainty.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�70c016206681�body��J最主要的原因是持续的经济增长，尤其是东亚和南亚，它带动了就业和收入提高；贸易开放、农业技术改良、基础设施投入，以及健康和教育普及也在同步发力。世界银行以每天生活费约2.15美元界定极端贫困，全球极端贫困率已从1990年的约38%降到近年的约9%，成绩主要来自中国、印度等国的大规模减贫。但这一进程并不均匀：撒哈拉以南非洲仍是难点，疫情和冲突还曾让全球减贫一度倒退，说明减贫既靠增长，也要靠社会保障和公平分配。�nThe dominant driver is sustained economic growth, especially in East and South Asia, which raised jobs and incomes, reinforced by open trade, better farming, infrastructure, and expanded health and education. Using the World Bank's extreme-poverty line of about 2.15 U.S. dollars a day, the global rate fell from roughly 38 percent in 1990 to about 9 percent recently, powered largely by large-scale poverty reduction in China and India. Progress is uneven, though: sub-Saharan Africa remains the hardest region, and pandemics and conflict set poverty reduction back, showing that both growth and social protection matter.�ans��src��C世界银行 (2022), 《贫困与共享繁荣 2022》, 世界银行�5World Bank (2022), Poverty and Shared Prosperity 2022��id�7389ea641bdf�body���默顿认为美国文化高度强调成功却未平等提供手段，造成结构性张力。个体可能以遵从、创新、仪式主义、退隐或反抗五种模式应对，其中“创新”即用非法手段追求主流目标。��Merton argued American culture overemphasizes success while under-providing means, producing structural strain. Individuals adapt via conformity, innovation, ritualism, retreatism, or rebellion; 'innovation' uses illicit means for mainstream goals.�ans��src��g罗伯特·K·默顿《社会结构与失范》(1938, 收入《社会理论与社会结构》1949/1968)�iRobert K. Merton, 'Social Structure and Anomie' (1938), in Social Theory and Social Structure (1949/1968)��id�783122ca8720�body���对来源国，移民汇款能增收但可能流失人才（“人才外流”）；对目的国，填补劳动力空缺、贡献税收，也带来融合与公共服务压力。净效应取决于政策与结构，难以一概而论。��For origin countries, remittances raise income but may drain talent (brain drain); for destinations, migrants fill labor gaps and pay taxes but add integration and service pressures. Net effects depend on policy and structure—no single verdict.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�7a3ef1405ae9�body�ي它描述社会从高低出生、高低死亡，经死亡率先降、出生率后降，最终走向低出生、低死亡的阶段演变。نIt describes the shift from high birth and death rates through falling mortality then fertility, to a low-birth-low-death equilibrium.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�7b51be01499f�body�ٺ该理论指当人感知自己的观点属少数时，会因怕被孤立而选择沉默，使多数意见显得更强、少数更沉默。社交媒体既能放大也能抑制此效应。��The theory says when people feel their view is minority, fear of isolation makes them stay silent, making the majority seem stronger and the minority quieter. Social media can amplify or dampen this effect.�ans��src��xNoelle-Neumann, E. (1974), 《沉默的螺旋：一种舆论理论》, 传播学期刊 (Journal of Communication), 24(2)�mNoelle-Neumann, E. (1974), The Spiral of Silence: A Theory of Public Opinion, Journal of Communication, 24(2)��id�7c7506a26401�body��文化生态学由朱利安·斯图尔德提出，研究人类文化如何适应特定自然环境，以及环境如何塑造生计、技术与社会组织。它强调文化与生态之间的相互调适。该视角对理解不同地区的多样生计方式很有价值。�ICultural ecology, proposed by Julian Steward, studies how human cultures adapt to specific natural environments and how environments shape subsistence, technology, and social organization. It stresses mutual adaptation between culture and ecology. The perspective is valuable for understanding diverse livelihoods across regions.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7c8a6a2191aa�body���存款准备金率是商业银行必须把存款的一定比例存在中央银行、不能贷出的制度。比率越高，银行可贷资金越少，货币创造能力越弱，是一种重要的货币政策工具。��The reserve requirement ratio is the share of customer deposits that commercial banks must hold at the central bank and cannot lend out. A higher ratio reduces lendable funds and the money-creation capacity, serving as a key monetary policy tool.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7e3824e71535�body��法玛在 1970 年系统阐述，若市场「有效」，所有已知信息都已反映在股价中，因此没有人能持续获得超额收益，价格只对新信息随机变动。该假说奠定了现代金融学的基准，却也因「市场异象」与泡沫而备受争议。�0Fama set out in 1970 that if markets are 'efficient,' all known information is already reflected in prices, so no one can consistently earn excess returns and prices move only randomly with new information. It became the benchmark of modern finance yet is debated because of market anomalies and bubbles.�ans��src��9Fama，《有效资本市场》，Journal of Finance 1970�:Fama, 'Efficient Capital Markets,' Journal of Finance 1970��id�7e39c3e6d639�body��&惩罚性司法以国家追诉、量刑报应为核心，关注违法者应受何种惩罚；恢复性司法则召集加害者、受害者和社区对话，聚焦修复伤害、承担责任与重建关系。其效果在部分轻罪与少年案件中显示可提升满意度并降低再犯率。�LRetributive justice centers on state prosecution and proportionate punishment, asking what the offender deserves; restorative justice convenes offender, victim, and community to repair harm, accept responsibility, and rebuild relationships. Evaluations in some minor and juvenile cases show higher satisfaction and lower recidivism.�ans��src��W联合国《关于在刑事事项中采用恢复性司法方案的基本原则》(2002)�\UN, Basic Principles on the Use of Restorative Justice Programmes in Criminal Matters (2002)��id�7fab6119d2aa�body��哈特在 1961 年主张法律是一套由“初级规则”（设定义务）与“次级规则”（规定如何制定、修改和裁判）结合的社会规则体系，并强调法律的“内在观点”。他以此批评奥斯丁的“命令说”过于简单。�+In 1961 Hart argued that law is a system of social rules combining “primary rules” (imposing duties) and “secondary rules” (governing how rules are made, changed, and adjudicated), emphasizing the “internal point of view.” He thereby critiqued Austin’s simplistic “command” theory.�ans��src��,H.L.A. 哈特《法律的概念》（1961）�,H.L.A. Hart, “The Concept of Law” (1961)��id�806882fe15f3�body��布迪厄在 1979 年提出，文化资本指通过家庭教养和教育获得的、能转化为社会优势的知识、品味与举止，与物质财富同为阶层再生产的重要机制。这解释了为何同等经济条件下的家庭在子女学业成就上仍有差异。�\Bourdieu proposed in 1979 that cultural capital is the knowledge, tastes, and manners acquired through family upbringing and education that can be converted into social advantage, alongside economic wealth as a mechanism of class reproduction. It helps explain why families with similar economic means differ in their children’s academic success.�ans��src��:皮埃尔·布迪厄《区隔》（La Distinction, 1979）�,Pierre Bourdieu, “La Distinction” (1979)��id�819765c22324�body���麦克弗森等指出人们倾向与相似者联结，导致网络同质化，使资源、信息与机会沿群体内循环、跨群体封闭。这放大结构性不平等并削弱桥接型流动。��McPherson et al. show people tend to connect with the similar, homogenising networks so resources, information and opportunity circulate within groups and close off across them. This amplifies structural inequality and weakens bridging mobility.�ans��src��vMcPherson, M., Smith-Lovin, L. & Cook, J. (2001), 《同质性之鸟：社会网络中的同质性》, 社会学年评�~McPherson, M., Smith-Lovin, L. & Cook, J. (2001), Birds of a Feather: Homophily in Social Networks, Annual Review of Sociology��id�82280a1e9beb�body��a理论上，失业保险降低了求职的机会成本，会提高保留工资、延长搜索时间，这是道德风险；但搜索经济学也指出，更长时间搜索能匹配到更合适的岗位，保障收入使人不必接受糟糕的工作。实证（如利用美国各州待遇差异的研究）显示给付越长或越慷慨，失业期越长，但幅度适中；对“给付到期前求职率骤升”的研究证实了激励效应。设计上常用递减给付、严格求职义务、资格审查与在职培训来平衡；“工作共享”政策则通过缩短工时而非裁员应对冲击。��In theory, UI lowers the opportunity cost of job search, raising reservation wages and prolonging search—moral hazard; but search theory notes longer search can yield better matches, and income support keeps people from taking bad jobs. Evidence (e.g., studies exploiting state-to-state differences in the US) shows longer or more generous benefits extend unemployment duration, but moderately; research showing job-finding jumps as benefits near expiration confirms the incentive channel. Designs commonly balance protection and incentives via declining benefits, strict job-search requirements, eligibility checks, and training; “work-sharing” policies respond to shocks by reducing hours rather than layoffs.�ans��src��2OECD (2019), 《就业展望 2019》, 经合组织�)OECD (2019), OECD Employment Outlook 2019��id�82bcbfc2d79f�body��阿罗在 1951 年证明：只要备选超过两个，任何同时满足「无限制域、一致同意、无关选项独立、非独裁」的投票规则都不可能存在。它说明把个人偏好「加总」成一致社会选择存在不可克服的逻辑障碍。�-Arrow proved in 1951 that with more than two options, no voting rule can simultaneously satisfy unrestricted domain, unanimity, independence of irrelevant alternatives, and non-dictatorship. It shows an unavoidable logical barrier to aggregating individual preferences into a consistent social choice.�ans��src��/Arrow，《社会选择与个人价值》(1951)�3Arrow, 'Social Choice and Individual Values' (1951)��id�82d55d494157�body��w1992年两人利用新泽西州上调最低工资、宾夕法尼亚州不变的“自然实验”，对快餐店做双重差分比较，发现就业并未下降，与标准竞争模型预测相悖，他们归因于企业买方垄断力。该研究引发方法革命，但后续验证并存：有的重复研究支持其发现，批评者则认为其数据采集窗口过短、样本噪声大；近年美国研究（如Cengiz等）发现适度提高最低工资对整体就业影响很小，而大幅度上调会显著减少就业。共识趋于“存在阈值与条件”，说明自然实验方法严谨但结论需多重验证。��In 1992, Card and Krueger used a natural experiment—New Jersey raising its minimum wage while neighboring Pennsylvania did not—and a difference-in-differences comparison of fast-food restaurants found no employment decline, contradicting the standard competitive model; they attributed this to monopsony. The study sparked a methodological revolution, but replications split: some confirmed the findings; critics argued the sampling window was short and noisy. Recent US research (e.g., Cengiz et al.) finds modest increases have little aggregate employment effect while large increases reduce employment substantially. The consensus is now conditional and threshold-based, showing that natural experiments are rigorous but conclusions need multiple verification.�ans��src��sCard, D. & Krueger, A. (1994), 《最低工资与就业：快餐业案例研究》, 美国经济评论 (AER), 84(4)لCard, D. & Krueger, A. (1994), Minimum Wages and Employment: A Case Study of the Fast-Food Industry, American Economic Review, 84(4)��id�83e08559275e�body��␀主流经济学把成因分成两类：总需求超过总供给的“需求拉动”，以及原材料、工资上涨推高成本的“成本推动”。而在长期，货币供应增长过快是持续通胀的根本原因，弗里德曼因此说“通胀在任何时候任何地方都是一种货币现象”。预期也很关键：一旦人们预期物价要涨，就会提前消费、要求加工资，通胀便自我实现。温和通胀（约2%）被视为健康，恶性通胀则会摧毁储蓄和信用。�5Mainstream economics splits the causes into demand-pull, where aggregate demand outstrips supply, and cost-push, where rising input costs and wages push prices up. In the long run, however, rapid money-supply growth is the fundamental driver, which is why Milton Friedman called inflation always and everywhere a monetary phenomenon. Expectations matter too: if people expect prices to rise, they spend early and demand raises, making inflation self-fulfilling. Mild inflation around 2 percent is considered healthy, while hyperinflation destroys savings and trust.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�84afc2cb23d3�body���早期有人主张在低效管制下，腐败能“买时间”、绕过官僚障碍，反而促进增长；但微观与跨国研究压倒性地显示相反结论：腐败降低投资率、扭曲公共支出结构（偏向有形资本而非教育健康）、抑制新企业进入与创新，且腐败者无法保证承诺，交易成本随不确定性上升。关键机制是“腐败与制度质量互补”：透明体制里小腐败成本有限，而弱制度国家中腐败侵蚀税基、司法和投资环境，形成恶性循环。因此计量上需处理双向因果——不是增长差导致腐败，而是腐败结构性拖累增长。�OSome early accounts argued that under burdensome regulation, corruption can “buy time” and bypass bureaucratic obstacles, even aiding growth; but micro and cross-country studies overwhelmingly find the opposite: corruption lowers investment rates, distorts public spending toward physical capital and away from education and health, and discourages firm entry and innovation, while corrupt deals cannot guarantee commitments and transaction costs rise with uncertainty. The key mechanism is complementarity between corruption and institutions: in transparent systems petty corruption costs little, but in weak-institution states corruption erodes the tax base, courts, and investment climate in a vicious circle. Estimation must therefore address reverse causality—weak growth does not cause corruption; corruption structurally drags growth.�ans��src��4World Bank（《治理与发展》等治理研究）�GWorld Bank (Governance and Development and related governance research)��id�864bbbb3bc0b�body���信息茧房指一个人只接触与自己既有观点一致的信息，仿佛被包围在自己的小世界里。它由推荐算法、社交关系的同质化和人自身的选择性接触共同促成：算法不断投喂你爱看的内容，你关注的圈子又都持相似观点，久而久之，不同群体对同一事实的认知差异被放大，观点极化加剧，公共讨论质量下降。缓解之道包括主动接触异质信息、提升媒介素养，以及推动算法更加透明。�An information cocoon means encountering only content that confirms your existing views, as if walled inside your own world. It's fed by recommendation algorithms, homogeneous social networks, and selective exposure: algorithms keep serving what you like, your circles share similar views, and over time, different groups' readings of the same facts diverge, polarization deepens, and public debate suffers. Remedies include deliberately seeking diverse information, media literacy, and greater algorithmic transparency.�ans��src��8Harvard Business Review（算法与信息茧房研究）�CHarvard Business Review (research on algorithms and filter bubbles)��id�86fd20f7ac22�body���当产权界定清晰、交易成本足够低、且相关方能够自由协商时，无论初始权利归谁，当事人都能达成有效率的结果；现实中交易成本和集体行动问题常使其难以实现。��When property rights are clear, transaction costs are low, and parties can bargain freely, an efficient outcome is reached regardless of who holds the initial right; in practice, transaction costs and collective-action problems often block this.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8732721b1e83�body��+民主和平论由迈克尔·多伊尔等学者在 1980 年代系统论证，认为民主国家因制度约束、相互透明的规范与和平解决争端的习惯，极少彼此开战。它已成为国际关系研究的经验性命题，但也长期伴随「选择性」与定义争议的批评。�dDemocratic peace theory, systematically argued by Michael Doyle and others in the 1980s, holds that democracies rarely wage war on one another because of institutional constraints, norms of transparency, and habits of peaceful dispute resolution. It is an empirical claim in international relations, though long debated over selection bias and definitions.�ans��src��RDoyle，《自由主义与世界政治》，American Political Science Review 1986�NDoyle, 'Liberalism and World Politics,' American Political Science Review 1986��id�877e5eb396ce�body���量化宽松是央行在利率近零时，直接购买国债等资产向市场注入流动性，以压低长端利率、刺激借贷与投资。它是非常规货币政策。过度使用可能推高资产泡沫与贫富差距。�!Quantitative easing is when a central bank, with rates near zero, directly buys government bonds and other assets to inject liquidity, lowering long-term rates and stimulating borrowing and investment. It is unconventional monetary policy. Overuse can inflate asset bubbles and inequality.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�87ef40f76e26�body�٥历史学家会核对不同来源是否一致、考察作者动机与时代背景、检验物质证据（如碳测年），并交叉验证以排除伪造或讹传。ٴHistorians cross-check sources for consistency, examine the author's motive and context, test physical evidence such as carbon dating, and corroborate to rule out forgery or error.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8a2d5bfd6575�body���当使用者转用强势语言、代际不再传授，语言便自然消亡，全球正以惊人速度消失。保护方言关乎文化多样性与本地记忆，但是否干预仍有争议。��When speakers shift to a dominant language and stop teaching it to the next generation, a language dies; globally they vanish at a startling rate. Preserving dialects concerns cultural diversity and local memory, though whether to intervene is debated.�ans��src��,民族语（Ethnologue, SIL International）�Ethnologue (SIL International)��id�8a65c9085476�body��P历史相对主义强调：评判过去的人和事，应当放在当时的社会、文化与价值背景下，而不是用今天的标准简单否定。它提醒我们历史叙述受立场和时代限制，没有绝对中立的视角。但相对主义不等于“怎么解释都对”——证据和逻辑仍是检验说法的底线。�rHistorical relativism holds that past people and events should be judged in their own social, cultural, and moral context rather than by today's standards alone. It reminds us that every narrative is shaped by standpoint and era, with no perfectly neutral viewpoint. But relativism is not 'anything goes'—evidence and logic remain the baseline for testing any account.�ans��src�٨Brown, McCullagh, Gellner,《Positivism, Relativism, and Narrative in the Logic of the Historical Sciences》,The American Historical Review,1987 (DOI: 10.2307/1863951)٦Brown, McCullagh, Gellner, 'Positivism, Relativism, and Narrative in the Logic of the Historical Sciences', The American Historical Review, 1987, DOI: 10.2307/1863951��id�8ab3683a8fde�body��在东亚朝贡体系下，周边国家以“进贡”名义携带商品来华，明朝与清朝以厚礼回赐，贸易服务于政治臣属关系而非纯利润。形式上官方管控严格，民间私贩则常被限制。它体现了贸易与外交的结合。�YUnder East Asia's tributary system, neighboring states brought goods to China as “tribute” and the Ming and Qing courts rewarded them with generous gifts; trade served political subordination rather than pure profit. It was tightly controlled by the state, while private trade was often restricted. It shows the blend of trade and diplomacy.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8b31b94f6935�body��泰勒规则由约翰·泰勒于 1993 年提出，建议政策利率随通胀偏离目标与产出缺口而调整，通胀越高、经济越过热，利率就应上调越多。它把货币政策操作变成可预期的规则，但也常被央行作为参考而非机械执行。�[Proposed by John Taylor in 1993, the Taylor rule advises that the policy interest rate should rise with inflation above target and with a positive output gap—the more overheated the economy, the higher the rate. It turns monetary policy into a predictable rule, though central banks typically treat it as a reference rather than a rigid formula.�ans��src��3Taylor，《实践中的自由裁量规则》(1993)�;Taylor, 'Discretion versus Policy Rules in Practice' (1993)��id�8bd07a960ae8�body���欧盟《数字市场法》（DMA）将具市场支配力的核心平台列为「守门人」，事前施加互操作、数据可携等义务，而不必等待事后证明垄断损害。它把监管重心从行为救济前移到结构性预防。�The EU Digital Markets Act designates dominant core platforms as 'gatekeepers' and imposes ex ante duties such as interoperability and data portability, without waiting to prove harm after the fact. It shifts regulation from behavioral remedies to structural prevention.�ans��src��/欧盟委员会《数字市场法》(DMA, 2022)�4European Commission, Digital Markets Act (DMA, 2022)��id�8c0fcaba5f97�body���奥尔森指出，集团越大，单个成员贡献对总收益的边际影响越小、搭便车的相对收益越高，理性个体因此倾向不出资。小集团因每人份额大更易克服惰性，大集团则需选择性激励才能动员。�$Olson notes that in larger groups each member's contribution barely moves the total benefit while free-riding yields private gain, so rational individuals withhold effort. Small groups, where each share is large, overcome inertia more easily; large ones need selective incentives to mobilize.�ans��src��*奥尔森《集体行动的逻辑》(1965)�3Mancur Olson, The Logic of Collective Action (1965)��id�8c9d9cf8e402�body���因为数据可以被大规模收集、分析和反复使用，个人几乎无法控制自己信息的流向；数据泄露、滥用画像和算法歧视会带来财产和心理损害，而且难以逆转。数据保护法（如欧盟《通用数据保护条例》GDPR）确立了知情同意、目的限定、更正与删除等原则，要求收集者承担责任。但数据同时具有流动价值，过度保护会阻碍创新和公共服务，因此立法需要在个人权利与数据利用之间权衡。�Because data can be collected, analyzed, and reused at scale, leaving individuals little control over where their information goes; breaches, profiling abuse, and algorithmic discrimination cause financial and psychological harm that's hard to reverse. Data-protection laws such as the EU's GDPR establish informed consent, purpose limitation, and rights to rectification and erasure, holding collectors accountable. But data also has flow value, so law must balance individual rights against innovation and public service.�ans��src��9欧盟委员会《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR, 2018)�DEuropean Commission, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, 2018)��id�8ce8589dcffa�body���信息不对称指交易双方掌握的信息不均等，卖方常比买方更了解商品质量。经济学家阿克洛夫用“柠檬市场”说明：当买家无法分辨好坏车，劣质车会挤走好车，市场可能失灵。�Information asymmetry means one party—often the seller—knows more about a product than the other. In “The Market for Lemons,” Akerlof showed that when buyers cannot tell good cars from bad, poor-quality “lemons” drive out good ones and the market can fail.�ans��src��曼昆《经济学原理》�Mankiw, Principles of Economics��id�8e8f826e967f�body���当抚养比因老龄化回升，劳动年龄人口占比下降，储蓄率与投资率往往走低，潜在增长率承压。若未提前建立普惠养老金与提高女性及老年劳动参与率，养老负担将转嫁财政并抑制消费。�'As the dependency ratio rises with aging and the working-age share falls, savings and investment rates tend to drop, pressuring potential growth. Without prepaid universal pensions and higher female and elderly participation, the old-age burden shifts to public finances and dampens consumption.�ans��src��G联合国人口司(UN Population Division)《World Population Ageing》�/UN Population Division, World Population Ageing��id�90735307e430�body��>以温特为代表的建构主义认为，国家的利益并非天生给定，而是由共享观念、规范和“身份”在互动中建构而成，无政府状态本身也是一种被实践塑造的社会结构。它强调观念与文化能改变国际政治，区别于物质主义的现实主义与自由主义。�ZConstructivism, associated with Alexander Wendt, holds that states’ interests are not given by nature but constructed through shared ideas, norms, and “identities” in interaction; anarchy itself is a social structure shaped by practice. It stresses that ideas and culture can change world politics, unlike materialist realism or liberalism.�ans��src��?亚历山大·温特《国际政治的社会理论》（1999）�EAlexander Wendt, “Social Theory of International Politics” (1999)��id�90bf10f98336�body��区域差距来自地理区位（港口、资源）、产业集聚、历史政策布局和人力资本等因素的叠加。经济地理学强调“集聚效应”：企业和人才集中在少数城市形成正反馈，越集聚越有吸引力；而欠发达地区常常陷入产业单一、人才外流、设施不足的循环。政策可以通过转移支付、基础设施投资和培育本地产业来缩小差距，但完全拉平既不现实也未必高效——关键是在整体增长中让各地区的居民都能分享机会。�fRegional gaps come from compounding factors: geography such as ports and resources, industrial agglomeration, historical policy, and human capital. Economic geography stresses agglomeration: firms and talent cluster in a few cities in a self-reinforcing loop, while lagging regions often get stuck in a cycle of single industries, out-migration, and weak infrastructure. Policy can narrow the gap through transfers, infrastructure, and developing local industries, but full equalization is neither realistic nor necessarily efficient; the key is letting people in all regions share opportunity amid overall growth.�ans��src��oFujita, Krugman & Venables,《The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade》(MIT Press, 1999)�kFujita, Krugman & Venables, The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade (MIT Press, 1999)��id�91813c4b4edd�body���常见维度包括政府对权力的约束、腐败控制、秩序与安全保障、基本权利保护、监管与司法有效等；不同机构加权不同，因此排名仅供横向参考。��Common dimensions are constraints on government power, control of corruption, order and security, protection of rights, and regulatory/judicial effectiveness; weightings differ across providers, so rankings are only rough comparisons.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�93ceab1b86fd�body��/政治极化指社会或政治精英在意识形态、政策立场上的分歧加剧，中间温和力量减弱、对立阵营相互排斥的现象。它可能导致立法僵局、治理效率下降和社会撕裂。近年来在多个民主国家，媒体与社交网络被认为加剧了极化趋势。�PPolitical polarization is the widening gap in ideology and policy positions among the public or elites, with a shrinking moderate center and mutual hostility between camps. It can cause legislative gridlock, weaker governance, and social fragmentation. In several democracies, media and social networks are seen as amplifying the trend.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�954ce22c70d2�body���沉没成本是已发生且无法收回的支出。理性决策只应比较未来的收益与成本，因为过去的钱无论如何都拿不回来。但人们出于“不想浪费”和“不愿承认失败”的心理，会继续给已无望的项目投入，这就是“沉没成本谬误”。它源于损失厌恶和维持自我形象的需要，理解了它才能及时止损。�dSunk costs are expenses already paid that can't be recovered. Rational choice compares only future benefits and costs, since past money is gone either way. Yet out of a wish not to waste and a refusal to admit failure, people keep investing in doomed projects, the sunk cost fallacy, rooted in loss aversion and self-image. Knowing it helps you cut losses.�ans��src��;《经济学原理》(曼昆)（决策与行为经济学）�JPrinciples of Economics (Mankiw), decision-making and behavioral economics��id�955449d4c562�body��岩石圈分成若干刚性板块，漂在软流圈上，靠俯冲下拉与洋脊前推带动，速度约每年几厘米，与指甲生长同量级；但千万年累积就是上千公里，够开合一个大洋。地貌随边界类型而定：碰撞带地壳缩短增厚成高山与高原；张裂带成洋中脊与裂谷；俯冲带留下海沟与火山弧。易混的是地形不只由内力刻成，抬升与侵蚀同时在跑，海拔是两者拉锯的结果；火山地震也大多贴着边界，板内与热点是例外。�The lithosphere is split into a handful of rigid plates riding the flowing asthenosphere, pulled down by subducting slabs and pushed along by ridges, at roughly a few centimetres a year, about the growth rate of a fingernail. But tens of millions of years add up to over a thousand kilometres, enough to open and shut an ocean whole. Landforms follow boundary type: collision shortens and thickens the crust into mountains and plateaus, rifting builds mid-ocean ridges and rift valleys, subduction leaves a trench and a volcanic arc. What gets mixed up is that interior forces do not carve the map alone — uplift and erosion run at the same time, so elevation is their tug of war, and volcanoes and quakes mostly hug the plate boundaries, with intra-plate and hotspot cases as exceptions.�ans��src��^Stein & Wysession,《地震学、板块与构造学导论》第2版,剑桥大学出版社,2013�zC. Stein and M. Wysession, An Introduction to Seismology, Plates, and Tectonics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2013��id�9575bfe32d25�body�٫央行大规模购买政府债券等资产，向金融体系注入准备金，以压低长期利率、刺激借贷与投资，通常在常规降息空间耗尽时使用。ٵThe central bank buys large-scale assets like government bonds to inject reserves, lowering long-term rates and encouraging lending, typically when standard rate cuts are exhausted.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�96b1cc6e362b�body���教育回报率指多受一年教育带来的收入增加比例，是衡量教育经济价值的核心指标。大量研究显示，基础教育与高等教育的回报率在多数国家均为正且显著。��The return on education is the percentage increase in earnings from one extra year of schooling—a key measure of education’s economic value. Studies broadly find positive, significant returns at both basic and higher levels.�ans��src��!Becker，《人力资本》(1964)�Becker, 'Human Capital' (1964)��id�97b8d580a302�body���哈贝马斯担心金钱与行政权力（系统）侵入原本靠沟通共识维系的生活世界，导致意义与团结的流失。理想言谈情境要求无强制、平等、真诚的论证，为民主商议提供规范性基准。�Habermas feared that money and administrative power (systems) invade the lifeworld sustained by communicative consensus, eroding meaning and solidarity. The ideal speech situation—coercion-free, equal, sincere argument—sets a normative standard for democratic deliberation.�ans��src���尤尔根·哈贝马斯《交往行动理论》(1981, 托马斯·麦卡锡英译本 1984-1987) ; 另见: Jürgen Habermas, The Theory of Communicative Action (1981; trans. Thomas McCarthy, 1984-87)��Jürgen Habermas, The Theory of Communicative Action (1981; trans. Thomas McCarthy, 1984-87) ; see also: 尤尔根·哈贝马斯《交往行动理论》(1981, 托马斯·麦卡锡英译本 1984-1987)��id�97da341a705e�body��)产权制度是一套法律与规则，规定谁对某样东西（土地、房屋、发明等）拥有使用、收益、处置和转让的权利。清晰且受保护的产权让人敢于投资和长期经营，因为知道收益归自己；它也是市场交换、融资和经济增长的基础。�XA property rights system is the set of laws and rules defining who may use, benefit from, transfer, or dispose of an asset such as land, a house, or an invention. Clear, protected rights encourage investment and long-term enterprise because people know the returns are theirs; they also underpin market exchange, financing, and economic growth.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�97e237d4689c�body���推荐算法以最大化参与度（点击、停留、转发）为目标，倾向推送情绪强、冲突性高、易引发反应的内容，客观上放大了极端与煽动性内容；同时通过A/B测试持续“学习”用户弱点，形成个性化信息环境。批评者认为，当系统设计目的就是利用认知偏差（愤怒、恐惧、成瘾循环）时，即使无恶意的“优化”也构成“数字操纵”；反对者则指出算法只是响应真实偏好，责任在用户与内容生产端。监管争论因此聚焦于透明度（可解释性、算法审计）、未成年人保护与“去成瘾化”设计，但精确划界仍无共识。��Recommendation algorithms maximize engagement (clicks, dwell time, shares) and tend to amplify emotional, conflict-heavy, reaction-prone content; through A/B testing they continually “learn” users' vulnerabilities, shaping a personalized information environment. Critics argue that when a system is designed to exploit cognitive biases (anger, fear, addiction loops), even well-intentioned “optimization” constitutes digital manipulation; opponents counter that algorithms merely respond to real preferences and that responsibility lies with users and content producers. Regulatory debate therefore centers on transparency (explainability, algorithmic audits), child protection, and “anti-addictive” design—yet a precise boundary remains unsettled.�ans��src��9Tim Wu,《The Attention Merchants》,Alfred A. Knopf,2016�5T. Wu, The Attention Merchants, Alfred A. Knopf, 2016��id�98495a570d63�body���把地球曲面展成平面地图必然产生变形，没有一种投影能同时保真面积、形状和距离。墨卡托投影保角却夸大高纬度面积，而等积投影会扭曲形状。��Flattening the globe onto a map inevitably distorts it—no projection preserves area, shape, and distance at once. Mercator keeps angles but inflates high-latitude areas; equal-area projections distort shapes.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�9908a16cfa59�body�ٴ许多真实网络（互联网、引文网）中少数节点拥有极多连接（枢纽），连接数服从幂律而非正态分布，使网络既健壮又对枢纽攻击脆弱。ٱIn many real networks (web, citations), few hubs hold most links and degrees follow a power law, not a normal distribution, making networks robust yet vulnerable to hub attacks.�ans��src��cWasserman, S. & Faust, K. (1994), 《社会网络分析：方法与运用》, 剑桥大学出版社�oWasserman, S. & Faust, K. (1994), Social Network Analysis: Methods and Applications, Cambridge University Press��id�9ad902a18e4b�body�ٺ意识形态是一套关于社会应如何组织、权力应如何分配的系统化观念，如自由主义、保守主义或社会主义，会影响政策和人们看世界的方式。��Ideology is a systematic set of ideas about how society should be organized and power distributed, such as liberalism, conservatism, or socialism. It shapes policy and how people view the world.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9cd1f2a81d1c�body�ٱ货币贬值指一国货币相对于其他货币的价值下降，同样数量的本币能换到的外币变少。它会使进口变贵、出口更便宜，从而影响贸易。ٶCurrency devaluation means a currency's value falls relative to others, so less foreign currency is obtained per unit. It makes imports costlier and exports cheaper, affecting trade.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9cf3c8b62a21�body���蒂利区分封闭政权与可进入的政体成员资格，主张当成员被排除或机会窗口打开时，群体以共同利益与组织网络发动抗争。他把运动视为常规政治诉求的延续而非非理性爆发。�Tilly distinguished a closed regime from an accessible polity membership; when groups are excluded or opportunities open, they mobilize on shared interests and organizational networks. He framed movements as continuity of normal political claim-making, not irrational outbursts.�ans��src��N查尔斯·蒂利《从动员到革命》(1978) 与《信任与统治》(2005)�OCharles Tilly, From Mobilization to Revolution (1978) and Trust and Rule (2005)��id�a1367da8d1ce�body���科登与尼里在 1982 年用荷兰天然气致富后制造业衰退的案例命名该现象：出口资源推高本币汇率，使制造业与农业「变贵、失去竞争力」。它说明「横财」也会通过汇率扭曲引发「去工业化」。�,Corden and Neary named the effect in 1982 after the Netherlands' manufacturing decline following a gas windfall: resource exports raise the currency, making manufacturing and farming too expensive to compete. It shows a windfall can also trigger de-industrialization through exchange-rate distortion.�ans��src��8Corden & Neary，《繁荣部门与去工业化》(1982)�@Corden & Neary, 'Booming Sector and De-industrialisation' (1982)��id�a218788f5174�body��涂尔干将自杀分为利己型、利他型、失范型与宿命型，主张社会纽带强弱与规范清晰度决定个体脆弱性。他用官方统计控制变量来论证“社会事实”独立于个人心理，奠定了用经验数据检验社会因果的范式。�<Durkheim classified egoistic, altruistic, anomic, and fatalistic suicide, arguing that the strength of social ties and clarity of norms shape individual vulnerability. By analyzing official statistics with controls, he demonstrated that 'social facts' exist independently of psychology, founding empirical sociology.�ans��src��v埃米尔·涂尔干《自杀论：社会学研究》(1897, 约翰·A·斯波尔丁与乔治·辛普森英译本 1951)�VEmile Durkheim, Suicide: A Study in Sociology (1897; trans. Spaulding & Simpson, 1951)��id�a26a4f17f5de�body��班尼特（Bennett）与赛格伯格提出，数字媒体使个人基于可分享的「个性化框架」自发协调，无需传统层级组织。相较于依赖领导与资源的「集体行动」，连接行动以松散、去中心、情感化的在线网络快速聚集。�#Bennett and Segerberg argue digital media let individuals coordinate via shareable personalized frames without traditional hierarchical organizations. Compared with resource-dependent collective action, connective action aggregates through loose, decentralized, affect-laden online networks.�ans��src��>Bennett & Segerberg,《The Logic of Connective Action》(2012)�:Bennett & Segerberg, The Logic of Connective Action (2012)��id�a294e34bbfe0�body���少年司法是专门针对未成年人违法的司法制度，侧重教育、矫治与回归社会，而非单纯惩罚。许多国家设有独立法庭与收容机构，并强调年龄相宜的程序。��Juvenile justice is the system for minors who offend, focused on education, rehabilitation, and reintegration rather than pure punishment. Many countries have separate courts and facilities with age-appropriate procedures.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�a35b82e86a2a�body���货币是现代信用的产物。中央银行垄断现金发行并调控基础货币，商业银行则通过贷款“派生”出存款货币——但这一切都建立在法律和监管之上：央行维系人们对货币的信任，银行受准备金率等约束，法律保证货币被普遍接受。如果人人能印钱，货币会因供给失控而快速贬值甚至崩溃。央行创造货币也并非没有边界，它必须维护价格稳定和金融稳定，过度印钞会引发恶性通胀。�-Money is a product of modern credit. The central bank monopolizes cash issuance and steers the monetary base, while commercial banks create deposit money through lending; but all of this rests on law and regulation: the central bank sustains trust in the currency, banks face reserve requirements, and law ensures the money is accepted. If everyone could print, the currency would depreciate fast and collapse. Central banks don't create money without limits either; they must defend price and financial stability, since over-issuance brings hyperinflation.�ans��src��2《经济学原理》(曼昆)（货币体系章）�9Principles of Economics (Mankiw), monetary system chapter��id�a40e96d0b190�body��软实力由约瑟夫·奈提出，指一国通过文化、价值观和外交政策吸引力而非强制或金钱来获取他国认同与配合的能力。它与军事、经济等“硬实力”相对。有效的软实力可降低成本、增强国际影响力。�/Soft power, coined by Joseph Nye, is a country's ability to attract and persuade others through culture, values, and foreign policy rather than coercion or payment. It contrasts with 'hard power' like military and economic force. Effective soft power can lower costs and enhance international influence.�ans��src�٣Rothman,《Revising the soft power concept: what are the means and mechanisms of soft power?》,Journal of Political Power,2011 (DOI: 10.1080/2158379x.2011.556346)١Rothman, 'Revising the soft power concept: what are the means and mechanisms of soft power?', Journal of Political Power, 2011, DOI: 10.1080/2158379x.2011.556346��id�a43eef2fd764�body���国际收支是一国与世界其他国家和地区在一定时期内的全部经济交易记录，主要包括经常账户（货物、服务、收入和转移）与资本和金融账户。它反映一国的对外经济地位和汇率压力。�The balance of payments is a record of all economic transactions between a country and the rest of the world over a period, mainly the current account (goods, services, income, transfers) and the capital and financial account. It reflects external position and exchange-rate pressure.�ans��src��W国际货币基金组织（IMF）《国际金融统计》；曼昆《经济学原理》�rInternational Monetary Fund (IMF), “International Financial Statistics”; Mankiw, “Principles of Economics”��id�a6fcf42883ab�body�ٮ路径包括事前审计与影响评估、透明度披露、行业自律，以及针对高风险应用的强制许可与人工监督，目标在创新与安全之间平衡。��Approaches include pre-deployment audits and impact assessments, transparency disclosure, self-regulation, and mandatory licensing with human oversight for high-risk uses, balancing innovation and safety.�ans��src��9欧盟委员会《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR, 2018)�DEuropean Commission, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, 2018)��id�a97f8f483252�body���大致流程是：问题被识别并进入议程，立法机关提出议案，经委员会审议、公开辩论、修改后表决，通过后由行政首脑签署或批准，然后配套实施细则、设立执法机构并接受司法与公众监督。现实中的政策过程并不是直线，而是利益集团、媒体、专家和公众多方博弈的过程，很多法律在讨论中反复修改，执行环节往往最终决定政策的实际效果。��Roughly: a problem is identified and put on the agenda; a bill is introduced, reviewed in committee, publicly debated, amended, and voted on; after passage the chief executive signs or approves it; then come implementing regulations, enforcement agencies, and judicial and public oversight. In reality the process is not linear but a bargaining game among interest groups, media, experts, and the public; many bills change repeatedly during debate, and implementation often decides the real outcome.�ans��src��,H.L.A. 哈特《法律的概念》（1961）�,H.L.A. Hart, “The Concept of Law” (1961)��id�aa261ac7f64a�body���全球价值链把产品拆成研发、零件、总装、品牌与销售等环节，按条件与成本分置各国，由主导企业以标准、订单与物流调度。收益与风险并不对等：主导企业握住附加值高的品牌与技术，把厂房、库存与需求波动的风险推给供应商，利润因此更靠近两端而非中段。也别混同于出口成品：链上多为中间品，同一产品反复过关，按总值计的贸易额因此重复计数。��A global value chain breaks a product into stages, namely research, component making, assembly, branding and selling, places them across countries according to conditions and cost, and is coordinated by lead firms through standards, orders and logistics. Gains and risks are not shared evenly: lead firms keep the brand and the technology, where most value is added, and push factories, inventory and the risk of falling demand onto suppliers, so profit sits nearer the two ends than the middle. Nor should this be confused with exporting finished goods: what moves along a chain are mostly intermediates, the same product may clear customs repeatedly, and trade counted in gross terms therefore tallies the same value more than once.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�aa9bbfbb3ac6�body��韦伯认为加尔文宗的预定论催生了“天职”观念与克制消费、勤勉积累的行为取向，为现代理性资本主义提供了精神动力。该命题以“理想类型”而非因果定律展开，因此常被争论其可证伪性与欧洲中心主义倾向。�Weber argued that Calvinist predestination bred a 'calling' and an ascetic, accumulative disposition that supplied the cultural drive for rational capitalism. Because he framed it with ideal types rather than causal laws, critics still debate its falsifiability and Eurocentric bias.�ans��src��e马克斯·韦伯《新教伦理与资本主义精神》(1905, 塔尔科特·帕森斯英译本 1930)�aMax Weber, The Protestant Ethic and the Spirit of Capitalism (1905; trans. Talcott Parsons, 1930)��id�aaadd7ed53e6�body�ٷ格式条款是商家预先拟定、对方不能协商的条款（如免责声明）。为防止强者欺弱，法律要求显著提示并排除不合理免责，否则可能无效。��A standard-form clause is pre-drafted by one party with no negotiation (e.g., disclaimers). To prevent the strong exploiting the weak, law requires prominent notice and voids unreasonable exemptions.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�aad674d8d8f4�body��,菲利普斯曲线最初描述失业率与货币工资增长率之间的反向关系，后来被扩展为失业与通货膨胀之间的权衡。在短期，适度的通胀可能伴随较低失业；但在长期，这种权衡往往消失。该曲线是现代宏观政策讨论的重要参考框架。�dThe Phillips curve originally described an inverse relationship between unemployment and wage inflation, later extended to a trade-off between unemployment and price inflation. In the short run, lower unemployment may come with higher inflation, but this trade-off tends to vanish in the long run. It remains a key framework in macroeconomic policy debate.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ab5f6b671464�body��2达尔在 1961 年《谁统治？》中通过对纽黑文市的实证研究，提出“多元政体”（polyarchy）——即权力分散在多个相互竞争的精英团体手中，而非由单一精英垄断。他主张现实民主应理解为多头竞争统治，而非理想化的人民直接统治。�"In 1961’s “Who Governs?” Dahl’s empirical study of New Haven introduced “polyarchy”—power dispersed among multiple competing elite groups rather than monopolized by one. He argued real democracy should be understood as competitive pluralism, not idealized direct popular rule.�ans��src��;罗伯特·达尔《谁统治？》（Who Governs?, 1961）�&Robert Dahl, “Who Governs?” (1961)��id�abe55621b78b�body���人道主义干预指为避免大规模人道灾难（如种族灭绝、饥荒），一国或多国在未获当事国同意时对其使用武力或施压。它在拯救生命与尊重主权之间长期存在争议。��Humanitarian intervention is the use of force or pressure by states without the target’s consent to avert mass atrocities like genocide or famine. It remains contested between saving lives and respecting sovereignty.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ac90b1696ff7�body���鲍德里亚认为在后现代消费中，物品的价值主要来自其符号差异而非使用功能，消费是对「能指」的系统性操控。这把消费从需求满足转为身份编码的社会游戏。�Baudrillard argues that in postmodern consumption, objects derive value mainly from sign difference rather than use, and consumption is systematic manipulation of signifiers. This shifts consumption from need-satisfaction to a social game of identity coding.�ans��src��ABaudrillard, J. (1970), 《消费社会》, 加利马尔出版社�ABaudrillard, J. (1970), The Consumer Society, Éditions Gallimard��id�acd8b0e9f30d�body�ٮ锚定指人在估计时过度依赖最先接触的信息（“锚”），后续调整往往不足。商家先标高价再打折、谈判中先开价，都利用了锚定。��Anchoring: people rely too heavily on the first piece of information (“the anchor”) when estimating, and adjustments are typically insufficient. Retail markdowns and first offers in negotiation exploit this bias.�ans��src��6丹尼尔·卡尼曼《思考，快与慢》（2011）�5Daniel Kahneman, “Thinking, Fast and Slow” (2011)��id�adc77c3c6fc4�body���观察数据常因混杂与选择偏差使相关不等于因果；自然实验利用外生政策冲击、工具变量借随机变异隔离因果通道。这些方法把社会学解释从联想推向机制验证。�Observational data confound cause with selection, so correlation is not causation; natural experiments exploit exogenous shocks and instruments isolate causal channels via random variation. These methods move sociology from association to mechanism testing.�ans��src���乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010) ; 另见: Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010)��Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010) ; see also: 乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010)��id�af4a67524edf�body���威权主义是一种权力高度集中、政治多元与公民自由受限的政体类型，与民主相对。它可由个人、军方或单一政党主导，通常缺乏竞争性选举与权力制衡。学者们研究其稳定性与转型条件。�LAuthoritarianism is a regime type with centralized power, limited political pluralism, and restricted civil liberties, in contrast to democracy. It may be led by an individual, the military, or a single party, usually lacking competitive elections and checks and balances. Scholars study its stability and conditions for transition.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b041c1c7a009�body��S语言随使用者的流失而消亡：经济、教育和媒体的强势语言吸引年轻一代放弃母语，父母不再教孩子少数民族语言，代际传承一旦断裂，语言就走向消亡——如今全球约7000种语言中，许多只剩下几千甚至几百名年长使用者。语言承载着特有的知识（草药、天文、生态经验）和文化记忆，失去往往不可逆。联合国因而把每年2月21日设为国际母语日，鼓励双语教育、语言记录和社区传承；但真正救活一种语言，靠的是让它有用、有尊严，而不是强制。��Languages die as their speakers drift away: economic, educational, and media pressure pulls the young toward dominant languages, parents stop passing the minority tongue on, and once intergenerational transmission breaks, the language fades. Many of the world's roughly 7,000 languages now have only a few thousand or a few hundred elderly speakers. Languages carry unique knowledge, such as herbal, astronomical, and ecological knowledge, and cultural memory, and loss is often irreversible. That's why the UN marks February 21 as International Mother Language Day, promoting bilingual education, documentation, and community transmission; yet a language is really saved by being useful and valued, not by force.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b08f8157003c�body�ٟICC可起诉个人战争罪，但常被指责侵蚀国家主权与豁免；美、中、俄等非缔约国不承认其管辖，限制其执行力与普遍性。ٸThe ICC prosecutes individuals for war crimes but is criticized for eroding sovereignty and immunity; major non-parties (US, China, Russia) reject its jurisdiction, limiting its reach.�ans��src��C《国际刑事法院罗马规约》(1998 年通过,2002 年生效)�NRome Statute of the International Criminal Court (adopted 1998, in force 2002)��id�b0deca8bd3cc�body��社会排斥指某些群体在就业、教育、住房、政治参与等方面被系统性边缘化、难以充分融入主流社会的状态。它比收入贫困更宽泛，强调参与机会的多维剥夺。反排斥政策强调赋能与包容性制度建设。�_Social exclusion is the systematic marginalization of some groups from employment, education, housing, and political participation, preventing full integration into mainstream society. It is broader than income poverty, emphasizing multidimensional deprivation of participation. Anti-exclusion policy emphasizes empowerment and inclusive institutions.�ans��src��QOECD (2011), 《分化中的我们：不平等为何持续上升》, 经合组织�:OECD (2011), Divided We Stand: Why Inequality Keeps Rising��id�b10035d66b97�body���19世纪末霍华德提出花园城市：在限制规模的小城中平衡住宅、工厂与农田，用绿带分隔，避免伦敦式的拥挤与污染。它影响了现代卫星城与新城规划。核心是用规划兼顾效率与生活品质。�IAt the end of the 19th century Howard proposed the garden city: small towns of limited size balancing homes, factories, and farmland, separated by green belts to avoid London-style crowding and pollution. It influenced modern satellite and new-town planning. Its core was using planning to balance efficiency and quality of life.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b17c61685d84�body��该机制通过两级审理（专家组、上诉机构）提供具约束力的裁决，使贸易规则可强制执行，因而被称为皇冠上的明珠。2019 年美国长期阻挠上诉机构法官任命，导致上诉机构成员不足而无法运作，机制陷入停摆。��The mechanism provided binding rulings through a two-tier process, making trade rules enforceable, hence the 'crown jewel' label. In 2019 the Appellate Body collapsed after the US blocked judge appointments, leaving too few members to hear appeals.�ans��src��L世界贸易组织(WTO)《关于争端解决规则与程序的谅解》(DSU)�UWTO, Understanding on Rules and Procedures Governing the Settlement of Disputes (DSU)��id�b1b4544d9f79�body���克伦肖在 1989 年提出，黑人群体的经验不能只用「种族」或只用「性别」理解，因为黑人女性同时承受两者的叠加歧视。交叉性提醒反歧视政策若只盯单一身份，会漏掉最被边缘的人。�Crenshaw argued in 1989 that Black people's experience cannot be understood by race alone or gender alone, because Black women face the combined bias of both. Intersectionality warns that anti-discrimination policy aimed at a single identity misses those most marginalized.�ans��src��8Crenshaw，《取消种族与性别的边缘化》(1989)�CCrenshaw, 'Demarginalizing the Intersection of Race and Sex' (1989)��id�b2e7ce48949f�body���均势指若干国家或联盟通过结盟与制衡，使任何一方都无法取得压倒性优势，从而维持体系稳定。它在近代欧洲（如维也纳体系）被用来防止霸权，是现实主义解释战争与和平的核心概念。�Balance of power means several states or alliances check one another so that no single side gains overwhelming dominance, maintaining systemic stability. Used in early modern Europe (e.g., the Vienna system) to prevent hegemony, it is a core realist concept for explaining war and peace.�ans��src��T汉斯·摩根索《国家间政治》（Morgenthau, Politics Among Nations, 1948）�4Hans Morgenthau, “Politics Among Nations” (1948)��id�b38b732336e7�body���结构洞指网络中两群互不联结的人之间的空缺；占据其间的人充当经纪人，能优先获取异质信息并控制资源流动。伯特据此把创业与晋升优势归因于网络位置而非个人特质。�
A structural hole is a gap between unconnected groups; the person spanning it acts as broker, gaining early heterogeneous information and control over resource flow. Burt attributes entrepreneurial and promotion advantages to network position, not individual traits.�ans��src��>罗纳德·伯特《结构洞：竞争的社会结构》(1992)�LRonald S. Burt, Structural Holes: The Social Structure of Competition (1992)��id�b3951af3367d�body���绝对优势指以更少资源生产某商品的能力；比较优势指生产该商品的机会成本更低。即使一国在所有产品上都有绝对优势，贸易仍能通过比较优势使各方互利。��Absolute advantage means producing with fewer inputs; comparative advantage means producing at lower opportunity cost. Even if one country has absolute advantage in everything, trade still benefits all via comparative advantage.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b3ec5b3d8eb3�body���程序正义关注裁判过程是否公平，而不只看结果对错。它包括中立的裁判者、双方充分陈述、理由公开等；即便结果不利，公正的程序也更让人信服。��Procedural justice concerns whether the process is fair, not just the outcome. It includes a neutral decision-maker, the chance for both sides to be heard, and public reasons—people accept unfavorable results more when procedures are fair.�ans��src��)Tyler,《Why People Obey the Law》(2006)�)Tom Tyler, Why People Obey the Law (2006)��id�b5b567df9414�body��D银行用活期存款（可随时提取）支持长期贷款，天然存在期限错配；只要存户同时取款，即使资产优质，银行也得低价抛售资产偿债，造成“自我实现的挤兑”。存款保险通过政府承诺覆盖一定额度的存款，消除存户的挤兑动机，从而稳定体系——这正是美国大萧条后设立FDIC的原因。但保险削弱了存户监督，银行可能更激进，产生道德风险，因此需要配套监管（资本要求、监管审查）和限额赔付。制度设计始终在稳定与激励之间权衡。�xBanks fund long-term loans with demand deposits that can be withdrawn anytime—an inherent maturity mismatch; if depositors all withdraw at once, even a solvent bank must fire-sell assets, creating a self-fulfilling run. Deposit insurance removes the incentive to run by government guarantee of deposits up to a limit—which is why the US created the FDIC after the Great Depression. But insurance weakens depositor monitoring, inviting riskier behavior—moral hazard—so it must be paired with capital requirements, supervision, and payout limits. Institutional design is a perpetual trade-off between stability and incentives.�ans��src��'IMF（《全球金融稳定报告》）�'IMF (Global Financial Stability Report)��id�b7c355c6234b�body���伦斯基在 1954 年提出，人的财富、教育、种族、声望等地位维度常不「同步」：例如高收入却低学历者会产生心理与社会紧张。这种「错位」比单纯的低地位更易引发不满与政治激进化。�Lenski argued in 1954 that status dimensions—wealth, education, race, prestige—often fail to line up: a high earner with little education, for example, feels social tension. This 'inconsistency' can breed more discontent and political radicalism than simply low status alone.�ans��src��*Lenski，《地位结晶化理论》(1954)�'Lenski, 'Status Crystallization' (1954)��id�bb45c1738023�body��波兰尼在《大转型》中指出，劳动力等商品是「虚拟商品」，完全市场化会破坏社会，因此社会会以保护性立法反向运动。这解释了为何劳动力市场始终被最低工资、工会等制度所嵌入，而非纯粹自由交换。�4In The Great Transformation, Polanyi argues that labour is a 「fictitious commodity」 whose full commodification would destroy society, prompting protective counter-movements. This explains why labour markets are always embedded in institutions like minimum wages and unions rather than pure free exchange.�ans��src��JPolanyi, K. (1944), 《大转型：我们时代的政治与经济起源》�\Polanyi, K. (1944), The Great Transformation: The Political and Economic Origins of Our Time��id�bbdbcc8fda9c�body��/普通法系（英美法系）以判例为主要法律渊源，强调法官通过先例发展法律；大陆法系（民法法系）以成文法典为核心，强调立法机关的系统性编纂。两者在司法推理和法律教育上差异显著。不少国家是混合或受两者影响的体系。�&The common law system relies mainly on judicial precedent, with judges developing law through case law, while the civil law system centers on codified statutes enacted by legislatures. They differ markedly in legal reasoning and legal education. Many countries are hybrid or influenced by both.�ans��src��iLa Porta, Lopez-de-Silanes, Shleifer & Vishny,《Law and Finance》(Journal of Financial Economics, 1998)�gLa Porta, Lopez-de-Silanes, Shleifer & Vishny, 'Law and Finance' (Journal of Financial Economics, 1998)��id�bd6a93f5ae6f�body���沿海国领海至多12海里享有主权；专属经济区至200海里拥有资源主权但允许航行自由；200海里外为公海，属人类共同利益，由《联合国海洋法公约》规范。٫Territorial sea (≤12 nm) is sovereign; the EEZ (≤200 nm) grants resource rights with freedom of navigation; beyond lies the high seas as common heritage, under UNCLOS.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bd99fe969f29�body��%出生率下降后，劳动年龄人口占比上升、被抚养人口占比下降，就形成“人口红利”：充足的劳动力、较轻的抚养负担和较高的储蓄率，为经济快速增长创造了条件，东亚多个经济体都曾抓住这一窗口。但红利不会自动兑现，需要教育普及和足够的就业岗位；它也会随老龄化消退——劳动年龄人口占比下降、老年抚养比上升，增长动力减弱。这正是许多国家如今转向提升劳动生产率、延迟退休和吸纳移民的原因。�After birth rates fall, the working-age share rises while the dependent share falls, creating a demographic dividend: ample labor, lighter dependency burdens, and higher savings that enable rapid growth, a window several East Asian economies seized. But the dividend isn't automatic; it needs education and jobs. It also fades with aging, as the working-age share shrinks and elderly dependency rises, weakening the growth engine. That's why many countries now lean on productivity, later retirement, and migration.�ans��src��$联合国（人口与发展研究）�4United Nations (population and development research)��id�be69b16afd2b�body��a网络效应指使用者的价值随用户规模增大而上升：社交、搜索、支付都存在直接（用户越多越有用）或间接（用户越多、配套商家越多）效应。这使市场容易“锁定”领先者，形成天然高进入壁垒，即使新产品更优也难撬动存量用户（转换成本）。传统反垄断以价格损害为中心，而平台常免费或低价，损害体现在质量、隐私、创新与排他行为上。监管手段从拆分、互操作与数据可携带、禁止自我优待到守门人义务不等，但都需权衡干预对创新激励的副作用。��Network effects mean a service's value rises with user numbers: direct (more users, more useful) or indirect (more users, more complementary merchants) effects operate in social media, search, and payments. This tends to lock in a leader and creates high natural entry barriers, so even superior newcomers struggle to move users (switching costs). Traditional antitrust centers on price harm, but platforms are often free or cheap, with harm in quality, privacy, innovation, and exclusion. Remedies range from breakup, interoperability and data portability, bans on self-preferencing, to gatekeeper obligations—all needing to weigh side effects on innovation incentives.�ans��src�٢Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor,《What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy》,Annual Review of Sociology,2020 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857)٠Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor, 'What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy', Annual Review of Sociology, 2020, DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857��id�be9f1977d245�body��相互依存理论认为国家间在经济、安全等领域高度牵连，使冲突的代价上升、合作的激励增强。它常与复合相互依存（如跨国行为体和多渠道联系）相联系。批评者提醒依存并不均衡，反而可能成为施压的工具。�AInterdependence theory argues that states are so linked in economics and security that the cost of conflict rises and incentives for cooperation grow. It is often linked to 'complex interdependence' with transnational actors and multiple channels. Critics note interdependence is uneven and can become a tool of pressure.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bea03a31016c�body���关键是比较优势而非绝对优势：即使某国生产所有商品都更高效，它也应当专攻机会成本最低的领域，再用产出交换其余商品。这样两国总产量和双方福利都会更大。比如美国仍进口服装，因为把劳动用在芯片和金融等高附加值领域更划算。这正是自由贸易能够互惠的原因，尽管转型期会带来产业调整和就业流失等代价。��The key is comparative advantage, not absolute advantage: even if one country is more efficient at everything, it should specialize where its opportunity cost is lowest and trade for the rest. Total output and welfare rise on both sides. The U.S. still imports clothing because its labor earns more in chips and finance. That's why free trade can be mutually beneficial, even though adjustment brings industry shifts and job losses.�ans��src��2《经济学原理》(曼昆)（国际贸易章）�=Principles of Economics (Mankiw), international trade chapter��id�bf3f229df192�body�ي无罪推定指任何人在被依法证明有罪之前，都应被视为无罪。举证责任在控方，这防止了随意给人定罪。٬Presumption of innocence means a person is considered innocent until proven guilty in court. The burden of proof lies with the prosecution, preventing arbitrary conviction.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c070b9ffe589�body��)芝加哥学派自1970年代确立“消费者福利”标准：只有损害价格、产出与效率的行为才应被诉，企业规模大本身不是过错，这使并购审查宽容、执法趋于克制。新布兰代斯学派则批评该标准忽视了市场集中对工人工资、供应商、创新和民主本身的影响，主张回到“结构推定”与更积极的执法。实践中，欧盟《数字市场法》针对“守门人”的规制与美国对大型平台的反垄断诉讼，都体现了两种范式交替带来的不确定性。�kSince the 1970s the Chicago School made consumer welfare the antitrust touchstone: only conduct that harms price, output, and efficiency should be challenged, and bigness per se is not an offense, producing lenient merger review and restrained enforcement. Neo-Brandeisians argue this standard ignores how concentration affects workers' wages, suppliers, innovation, and democracy itself, calling for structural presumptions and vigorous enforcement. In practice, the EU's Digital Markets Act targeting “gatekeepers” and US antitrust suits against big platforms reflect the uncertainty as these paradigms alternate.�ans��src��yLindeboom,《Two Challenges for Neo-Brandeisian Antitrust》,The Antitrust Bulletin,2023 (DOI: 10.1177/0003603x231180251)�wLindeboom, 'Two Challenges for Neo-Brandeisian Antitrust', The Antitrust Bulletin, 2023, DOI: 10.1177/0003603x231180251��id�c13516a809a4�body��G参与观察是人类学与社会学常用的田野方法，研究者深入到所研究群体之中，既观察又在一定程度上参与其日常活动以收集资料。它能获得深入、情境化的理解，但也面临主观偏差与伦理问题。马林诺夫斯基的田野工作被视为该方法的奠基性实践。�VParticipant observation is a fieldwork method in anthropology and sociology where the researcher lives within the group, both observing and partially taking part in daily life to gather data. It yields deep, contextual understanding but faces subjectivity bias and ethical issues. Malinowski's fieldwork is seen as foundational to the method.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c234503f420f�body���一国若长期干预外汇市场压低本币以提振出口，可能被他国指控“汇率操纵”。它通过贸易顺差积累储备、扭曲竞争。IMF与贸易伙伴会据此施压，但它与正常货币政策的边界常存争议。�7When a country persistently intervenes to depress its currency and boost exports, others may accuse it of “currency manipulation.” It accumulates reserves via trade surplus and distorts competition. The IMF and trade partners pressure such behavior, though the line from normal monetary policy is contested.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c3df6448ab0f�body���通胀税并非政府直接征收，而是货币超发使持有现金者购买力被悄悄稀释，相当于对现金持有人的隐性征税。它不体现在税单上，却真实减少财富。��An inflation tax is not levied directly; it is the silent erosion of cash holders’ purchasing power from money over-issue—an implicit tax on cash. It never appears on a tax bill yet genuinely cuts wealth.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c484a7428f9b�body���途径包括投票、参与社区事务、参加听证会和意见征集、加入公益或利益团体、写信和网络表达意见、参与志愿服务，甚至发起倡议或公益诉讼。参与的意义不仅是影响结果，更在于过程价值：让决策者了解多元需求、增强决策的合法性，同时培养公民的责任感和协商能力。但参与本身也不平等——时间、资源、信息多的人声音更大，因此制度设计需要为弱势群体留出表达空间。�!Channels include voting, community affairs, public hearings and comment periods, joining civic or advocacy groups, writing and posting opinions, volunteering, and even launching petitions or public-interest lawsuits. Participation matters beyond outcomes: it surfaces diverse needs, strengthens the legitimacy of decisions, and cultivates civic responsibility and deliberation. Participation is itself unequal, since those with more time, resources, and information speak louder, so institutional design must leave room for disadvantaged voices.�ans��src��6Robert Putnam,《Bowling Alone》Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000��id�c4a71e1ce302�body��司法独立指法院和法官在审理案件时不受立法、行政或其他外部力量不当干预，仅依据法律与事实裁判。它是实现公正审判和权力制衡的重要保障。制度上常通过法官任期、薪酬保障和管辖安排来维护独立。�EJudicial independence means courts and judges decide cases free from improper interference by the legislature, executive, or other outside forces, basing rulings only on law and facts. It is vital for fair trials and checks and balances. It is typically protected through tenure, salary safeguards, and jurisdictional design.�ans��src�مEntin,《Getting What You Pay For: Judicial Compensation and Judicial Independence》,Utah Law Review,2011 (DOI: 10.63140/dgoxmg-jyd)كEntin, 'Getting What You Pay For: Judicial Compensation and Judicial Independence', Utah Law Review, 2011, DOI: 10.63140/dgoxmg-jyd��id�c56c519ca552�body���低利率与房价上涨催生次级贷款激增，银行把房贷打包成MBS/CDO出售以转移风险并回收资金继续放贷；证券化使风险层层叠加，评级被高估，投资者与机构用短期回购融资持有这些证券，杠杆高企。当房价见顶回落、违约率上升，证券价值暴跌，依赖短期融资的影子银行体系遭遇挤兑式去杠杆，被迫抛售资产，价格螺旋下跌；雷曼破产引发对交易对手风险的恐慌，信贷冻结，危机从金融蔓延到实体。监管缺位——低资本要求、表外工具、对评级机构的依赖——是危机放大的制度根源。��Low rates and rising house prices fueled a subprime surge; banks bundled mortgages into MBS/CDOs to offload risk and recycle funds into more lending. Securitization stacked risks and inflated ratings; investors and institutions held these securities funded by short-term repos at high leverage. When prices peaked and fell, defaults rose, securities collapsed, and the shadow-banking system dependent on short funding faced a run-like deleveraging—forced selling created a price spiral. Lehman's failure ignited counterparty panic, credit froze, and the crisis spread from finance to the real economy. Regulatory gaps—low capital requirements, off-balance-sheet vehicles, reliance on credit-rating agencies—were the institutional amplifiers.�ans��src��'IMF（《全球金融稳定报告》）�'IMF (Global Financial Stability Report)��id�c79ba10174d6�body��t国家贫富差距主要来自制度、地理与历史因素的组合。保护产权、法治和有效率的市场制度能激励生产与投资；地理位置（气候、海岸线、资源）影响贸易与农业；教育、技术和人力资本决定生产力；殖民历史、战争与政策选择也留下长期影响。没有单一原因，而是多种因素叠加。��Differences in national wealth come from a mix of institutions, geography, and history. Institutions that protect property rights, enforce the rule of law, and support efficient markets encourage production and investment; geography (climate, coastlines, resources) shapes trade and agriculture; education, technology, and human capital set productivity; and colonial history, war, and policy choices leave long-lasting marks. No single cause explains it—factors stack up.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�cc4a3697e37f�body���士绅化指中高收入者迁入老旧街区，带动翻新、商业升级和房价上涨。支持者看到环境改善、治安好转、税收增加；反对者担心原住的低收入居民被房租和房价挤走，社区文化与熟人网络被破坏，即“驱逐性士绅化”。学者普遍认为，问题不在于改造本身，而在于有没有同步提供可负担住房、让原居民分享收益；否则升级就是以本地人的流失为代价。�Gentrification is when middle- and high-income residents move into older districts, driving renovation, upscale commerce, and rising property values. Supporters see better environments, safer streets, and more tax revenue; opponents fear low-income residents are priced out and local culture and networks are destroyed, so-called displacement gentrification. Scholars generally agree the issue isn't redevelopment itself but whether affordable housing and gains reach original residents; without that, upgrading comes at their expense.�ans��src��Su, Hu, Wu,《Inclusive urban renewal: Housing demolition and gentrification》,Cities,2026 (DOI: 10.1016/j.cities.2025.106491)�}Su, Hu, Wu, 'Inclusive urban renewal: Housing demolition and gentrification', Cities, 2026, DOI: 10.1016/j.cities.2025.106491��id�cc50b506e372�body�ٱ中产迁入改善老旧街区会推高房价与租金，原低收居民被迫迁出（绅士化），带来空间不平等与文化置换，需以可负担住房政策缓冲。ٮInflow of middle-class residents upgrades old neighborhoods and raises housing costs, displacing low-income residents (gentrification), demanding affordable-housing policies.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�cd9057cded86�body��库兹涅茨曲线由西蒙·库兹涅茨在 1955 年提出，描述在工业化早期收入不平等会随增长而扩大，到达拐点后又逐渐缩小，呈倒 U 形。它基于美国、英国等历史数据，但对发展中国家的适用性长期存在争议。�Proposed by Simon Kuznets in 1955, the curve describes an inverted-U relationship: income inequality first rises with early industrial growth, then narrows after a turning point. Based on historical U.S. and U.K. data, its applicability to developing countries remains debated.�ans��src�ي库兹涅茨《经济增长与收入不平等》（Kuznets, “Economic Growth and Income Inequality”, 1955, American Economic Review）�UKuznets, “Economic Growth and Income Inequality,” American Economic Review (1955)��id�cda4ae226053�body��集体安全指参与国约定，对任一成员国的攻击视为对全体的攻击，从而共同防御，如《联合国宪章》确立的集体安全机制与北约第五条的集体防御条款。它用“共同威慑”降低单个国家被侵略的风险。�Collective security is an arrangement where an attack on one member is treated as an attack on all, prompting joint defense—seen in the UN Charter’s security framework and NATO’s Article 5. Shared deterrence lowers each state’s risk of being attacked.�ans��src��"北大西洋公约组织（NATO）�NATO��id�d092fc90ff42�body���粘合型资本强化群体内团结但可能排斥外人，桥接型资本连接异质群体、拓宽机会与信息。普特南指出，过度依赖粘合型资本会加深割裂，而培育桥接型资本更利于跨群体合作与减贫。�'Bonding capital strengthens in-group ties but can exclude outsiders; bridging capital links heterogeneous groups, widening opportunity and information. Putnam notes over-reliance on bonding deepens division, while fostering bridging better supports cross-group cooperation and poverty reduction.�ans��src�� Putnam,《Bowling Alone》(2000)�#Robert Putnam, Bowling Alone (2000)��id�d196cf6ef0d1�body��x短期受利率差、资本流动与市场预期影响，长期则趋近购买力平价，即两国物价水平之比。٠Short-term rates reflect interest differentials, capital flows, and expectations; long-run rates tend toward purchasing power parity, the ratio of price levels.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d2a8b7b7f936�body���物质文化关注器物、技术与空间如何承载并塑造意义，主张「物」并非被动容器而是行动者。拉图尔的行动者网络理论表明，人与非人要素共同构成混合网络，从而模糊了天然与人为的界限。�Material culture studies attend to how objects, technologies, and spaces carry and shape meaning, treating things as active rather than passive containers. Latour's actor-network theory shows human and non-human elements form hybrid networks, blurring the nature-culture boundary.�ans��src��*拉图尔《我们从未现代过》(1991)�.Bruno Latour, We Have Never Been Modern (1991)��id�d624f2c6b638�body�ٟ随着消费单位增加，每新增一单位带来的满足感逐渐下降，这解释了需求曲线向下倾斜以及人们偏好多样化的消费行为。ٔAs consumption increases, each additional unit yields less satisfaction, which helps explain downward-sloping demand and the preference for variety.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d6b073f64845�body��A鲍莫尔成本病指：当制造业因技术进步而生产率快速提升时，理发、演出等难以自动化的服务业生产率停滞，却须支付同等工资，导致单位成本上升、价格相对变贵。该理论由鲍莫尔与鲍恩在 1966 年提出，揭示了「不平衡增长」的结构性来源。�dBaumol's cost disease notes that as manufacturing productivity rises quickly through technology, hard-to-automate services like haircuts or live performances see stagnant productivity yet must pay comparable wages, pushing up their unit costs and relative prices. Baumol and Bowen proposed this in 1966, exposing a structural source of 'unbalanced growth'.�ans��src��DBaumol，《宏观不平衡增长》，American Economic Review 1967�LBaumol, 'Macroeconomics of Unbalanced Growth,' American Economic Review 1967��id�d81ebce41b62�body��当学生被分流到不同层级班级，教师期望、同伴群体与课程深度随之分化，自我实现预言使被标为「低能」者降低投入。实证研究（如 Oakes）显示，分流常以阶层与种族为隐性边界，固化而非弥合不平等。�$Once students are streamed into levels, teacher expectations, peer groups, and curriculum depth diverge, and the self-fulfilling prophecy leads low-track students to disengage. Research such as Oakes shows tracking often follows class and race lines, cementing rather than closing inequality.�ans��src��2Oakes,《Keeping Track》(1985) 教育分层研究�#Jeannie Oakes, Keeping Track (1985)��id�d959bdacbaae�body�ٱ贸易逆差指一个国家从国外进口的商品和服务总值，大于它出口到国外的总值。长期逆差可能带来外债，但也可能反映国内消费旺盛。ٮA trade deficit occurs when a country imports more goods and services than it exports. Persistent deficits can build foreign debt but may also reflect strong domestic demand.�ans��src��CN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017�=N. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017��id�d97c120a1eac�body���贝克尔认为并非行为本身而是被有权者贴上标签才成为越轨，道德企业家通过推动规则把某些群体标记为越轨者。标签一旦内化会引发“二次越轨”，凸显权力在定义秩序中的作用。�Becker argued deviance is not intrinsic to acts but results from being labeled by those in power; moral entrepreneurs lobby to create rules that mark groups as deviant. Internalizing the label can trigger secondary deviance, highlighting power in defining order.�ans��src��D霍华德·S·贝克尔《局外人：越轨社会学研究》(1963)�HHoward S. Becker, Outsiders: Studies in the Sociology of Deviance (1963)��id�dba2a2a8562f�body�ٖ蒙台梭利强调让儿童在准备好的环境中自主选择活动、动手操作，老师作为引导者，培养独立性与内在学习动力。٭Montessori lets children freely choose activities in a prepared environment and learn by doing, with the teacher as a guide, fostering independence and intrinsic motivation.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e06559695828�body���协商民主强调公民通过理性讨论、倾听对立观点来形成公共决策，而不仅是投票计票。它旨在提升决策的质量与正当性，常见于公民陪审团、专题听证等形式。��Deliberative democracy emphasizes citizens reaching decisions through reasoned discussion and listening to opposing views, not merely counting votes. It aims to improve the quality and legitimacy of decisions via forums like citizen juries.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e10167e0b68f�body��当总和生育率长期低于更替水平（约2.1）时，若不考虑迁移，人口将趋向萎缩；高于更替水平则趋向扩张。由于人口惯性，生育率变化对总量的影响往往滞后数十年才充分显现。因此政策响应需要长期视角。�*When the total fertility rate stays below replacement level (about 2.1) without migration, a population tends to shrink; above it, it tends to grow. Due to population momentum, the effect of fertility change on total size often lags decades. Policy responses therefore need a long-term perspective.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�e21cdef3414b�body���SDGs是2015年联合国通过、计划2030年实现的17项目标，涵盖消除贫困与饥饿、优质教育、性别平等、清洁水与卫生、气候行动等，每项目标下还有具体可衡量的指标。它们代表国际共识：发展不能只看经济数字，必须同时兼顾社会公平和环境可持续，不能让一部分人的进步以另一部分人或子孙后代的损失为代价。各国据此制定政策、跟踪进度并定期评估。�&The SDGs are 17 goals adopted by the UN in 2015 for achievement by 2030, covering no poverty, zero hunger, quality education, gender equality, clean water and sanitation, climate action, and more, each with concrete measurable targets. They embody an international consensus that development is more than economic figures; it must balance social fairness with environmental sustainability, without letting some people's progress come at others' or future generations' expense. Countries use them to set policy, track progress, and review performance.�ans��src��+联合国（2030年可持续发展议程）�8United Nations (2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development)��id�e3d260dcb051�body��知识产品（新药、软件、书、音乐）复制的成本极低，若没有保护，投入研发和创作的人难以收回成本，创新和创作就会减少。专利和版权在有限时间内授予排他权，把创造性劳动转化为可获利的产权，以此激励创新。代价是形成垄断：权利人可能定高价、阻碍后续研究，所以保护期有限（发明专利一般20年），并有合理使用、强制许可等例外——本质上是在激励创新与公共利益之间寻找平衡。�aKnowledge goods, such as new drugs, software, books, and music, cost almost nothing to copy; without protection, creators couldn't recoup their investment and innovation would shrink. Patents and copyrights grant exclusive rights for a limited time, turning creative labor into profitable property and thus rewarding innovation. The cost is monopoly: right-holders may charge high prices and block follow-on research, which is why terms are limited, typically 20 years for patents, with fair-use and compulsory-licensing exceptions, fundamentally a balance between rewarding innovation and serving the public.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e610e624d629�body���音素是某种语言中能区分词义的最小语音单位。例如汉语“b”和“p”是不同音素（“八/趴”），但在某些语言里这种差别不改变词义，因此不构成音素对立。��A phoneme is the smallest sound unit that distinguishes meaning in a language. In Mandarin, /b/ and /p/ are separate phonemes (“ba” vs “pa”), but in some languages that difference does not change meaning and so is not a phonemic contrast.�ans��src��dTrager,《What Conditions Limit Variants of a Phoneme?》,American Speech,1934 (DOI: 10.2307/452203)�bTrager, 'What Conditions Limit Variants of a Phoneme?', American Speech, 1934, DOI: 10.2307/452203��id�e773b059b004�body���为降低远链运输风险、缩短交期并应对关税与地缘不确定性，企业把生产从远端转移到邻近地区；它提升韧性却常伴随成本上升与产能重新布局。��To cut long-haul risk, shorten lead times, and hedge tariffs and geopolitical uncertainty, firms move production closer to home markets; it raises resilience but often at higher cost and the need to rebuild capacity.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�e785b07af2e6�body���考德威尔主张在传统社会财富从子女流向父母（儿童是资产），现代化后转为父母向子女净投资（儿童成负担），从而抑制生育。该理论把生育选择嵌入家庭经济学与代际权力。�Caldwell argued that in traditional societies wealth flows from children to parents (children as assets); modernization reverses it to net parental investment, discouraging fertility. The theory embeds fertility choice in family economics and generational power.�ans��src��d约翰·考德威尔《财富流向理论与生育转变》(1976, Population and Development Review)�sJohn C. Caldwell, 'Toward a Restatement of Demographic Transition Theory' (1976), Population and Development Review��id�e79e03f6935c�body���大体分三类：全民政府型（英国NHS，税收直接筹资、国家提供）、社会保险型（德国/日本，雇主雇员缴费、公共基金、多元提供者）、商业保险主导型（美国以雇主保险为主、Medicare/Medicaid为补充）。单一支付者模式行政成本低、覆盖面广、药品价格谈判能力强，但可能有等待时间和创新激励问题；商业保险主导模式选择多、创新快，但行政成本高、未投保人群风险大。OECD数据显示美国人均医疗支出远高于他国，而多项健康指标并不占优——说明“花更多钱不等于更好的健康”。��Systems fall roughly into three types: national health service (UK NHS, tax-funded, state-provided), social insurance (Germany/Japan, employer-employee contributions, public funds, plural providers), and private-insurance-dominant (US employer insurance with Medicare/Medicaid). Single-payer models have low administrative costs, broad coverage, and strong drug-price negotiation, but can face waiting times and weaker innovation incentives; private-insurance models offer choice and fast innovation but high administrative costs and uninsured risk. OECD data show the US spends far more per capita than peers without superior health outcomes—spending more is not the same as being healthier.�ans��src��OECD（《健康一览》）�OECD (Health at a Glance)��id�e7c5467903ab�body��受教育年限与能力、家庭背景等混淆因素相关，简单回归会高估回报。研究者用「义务教育法变动」「学校距离」等外生工具隔离教育的因果效应，卡卡万（Card）以此估计美国教育的局部平均处理效应。�/Years of schooling correlate with ability and family background, so naive regression overstates returns. Researchers use exogenous instruments like compulsory-schooling-law changes or school distance to isolate causality; Card used such instruments to estimate local average treatment effects in the US.�ans��src��BCard,《Quarterly Journal of Economics》(1995) 教育回报研究وDavid Card, 'Using Geographic Variation in College Proximity to Estimate the Return to Schooling', Quarterly Journal of Economics (1995)��id�e7d666956a2b�body���大量研究一致发现“确定性（被抓获概率）比严厉性（刑期长短）更能威慑犯罪”，因为潜在罪犯对被抓概率更敏感。关于死刑威慑的争议极大：早期“每执行一次可挽救若干生命”的估计后来多被批评存在方法缺陷，近年准实验研究（如邻州废除与保留死刑的比较）总体未发现死刑有明显额外威慑效应。较扎实的发现是：增加街头警力与破案投入有威慑作用，而单纯延长刑期边际效果递减，甚至可能通过“监狱学习”机制增加再犯。政策含义是惩罚资源应偏向确定性而非一味加重。�"Research consistently finds that certainty of apprehension deters crime more than severity of sentence, because potential offenders respond more to detection probability. The death-penalty deterrence literature is deeply contested: early estimates claiming each execution saves several lives were later criticized for methodological flaws, and recent quasi-experimental comparisons (e.g., neighboring states abolishing versus keeping capital punishment) find no robust additional deterrent effect. Firmer findings are that visible policing and detection effort deter, while merely lengthening sentences has diminishing marginal effects and may even increase recidivism through “prison as a school of crime.” The policy implication: allocate punishment resources toward certainty, not pure severity.�ans��src��;UN（联合国毒品和犯罪问题办公室研究报告）�UN (UNODC research reports)��id�e93d58f03b25�body���生命表是汇总各年龄死亡概率、预期余命等指标的统计表，是人口学与保险精算的基础工具。它既能描述当前死亡模式，也可用于预测未来人口动态。��A life table summarizes age-specific death probabilities and remaining life expectancy; it underpins demography and actuarial science. It both describes current mortality and projects future population dynamics.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�ea7b55e1dcde�body���国际音标由国际语音协会（IPA）于 1888 年首次制定，用一套与声音一一对应的符号精确记录人类语言的各种发音，不受具体文字拼写干扰。它是语言学和词典编纂标注发音的标准工具。�The International Phonetic Alphabet was first published by the International Phonetic Association in 1888, using one symbol per sound to record speech precisely regardless of spelling. It is the standard tool for transcription in linguistics and lexicography.�ans��src��R国际语音协会（International Phonetic Association）《国际音标手册》�=International Phonetic Association, “Handbook of the IPA”��id�ea90432660a2�body��␀在《神话学》中，他将「生/熟」视为自然与文化的对立轴，烹饪作为文化对自然的转化成为普遍心智结构的符号。通过跨文化的神话变体比较，他主张人类思维以二元对立及其调解来组织意义。�$In Mythologiques, he reads raw/cooked as the nature/culture axis, with cooking as culture's transformation of nature, a symbol of universal mental structure. Comparing mythic variants cross-culturally, he argues the human mind organizes meaning through binary oppositions and their mediation.�ans��src��7列维-斯特劳斯《神话学》(Mythologiques, 1964)�)Claude Levi-Strauss, Mythologiques (1964)��id�ec0433b415d9�body���支持方指出个性化推送增加同质内容暴露；反对方（如 Nature Human Behaviour 多项研究）发现多数用户主动选择极化内容，算法效应小于既往假设，离线因素仍主导。�Proponents note personalised feeds raise exposure to homogeneous content; critics (e.g., several Nature Human Behaviour studies) find most users actively choose polarising content and that algorithmic effects are smaller than assumed, with offline factors still dominant.�ans��src�٭Lorenz-Spreen, P., Oswald, L., Lewandowsky, S. & Hertwig, R. (2023), 《数字媒体与民主的世界因果与相关证据系统综述》, 自然·人类行为, 7, 74–101��Lorenz-Spreen, P., Oswald, L., Lewandowsky, S. & Hertwig, R. (2023), A systematic review of worldwide causal and correlational evidence on digital media and democracy, Nature Human Behaviour, 7, 74–101��id�ec8ca97218a9�body���沃思把城市性视为由人口规模大、密度高、异质性强共同塑造的生活模式，导致次级关系、匿名与正式控制取代亲密共同体。该生态学视角奠定了城市社会学的经典命题。��Wirth defined urbanism by large size, high density, and heterogeneity, yielding secondary relationships, anonymity, and formal control replacing intimate community. This ecological framing set classic urban-sociology propositions.�ans��src��`路易斯·沃思《作为一种生活方式的城市性》(1938, American Journal of Sociology)�NLouis Wirth, 'Urbanism as a Way of Life' (1938), American Journal of Sociology��id�ee1cf55fbdf2�body���福山区分基于血缘与熟悉的「厚信任」与对陌生人的「薄信任（普遍信任）」。普遍信任越高的社会，越能在大规模陌生人协作中降低交易成本、扩展社会资本的外延。�Fukuyama distinguishes 「thick」 trust based on kinship and familiarity from 「thin」 (generalised) trust toward strangers. Societies with higher generalised trust can lower transaction costs in large-scale stranger cooperation and extend the reach of social capital.�ans��src��VFukuyama, F. (1995), 《信任：社会美德与创造经济繁荣》, 自由出版社�YFukuyama, F. (1995), Trust: The Social Virtues and the Creation of Prosperity, Free Press��id�ef003db22493�body���杜波依斯以系统入户调查写就美国首部城市社区社会学专著，量化就业、教育与居住隔离。他同时用“双重意识”刻画黑人在“美国人”与“黑人”两种自我间的撕裂体验。�Du Bois produced the first urban community sociology monograph via systematic household surveys, quantifying employment, education, and residential segregation. His 'double consciousness' captures the divided self of Black Americans between 'American' and 'Negro' identities.�ans��src��9W.E.B.杜波依斯《费城黑人：社会研究》(1899)�=W.E.B. Du Bois, The Philadelphia Negro: A Social Study (1899)��id�f0d36e2c7bf2�body�وPISA由OECD每三年测评15岁学生的阅读、数学与科学素养，但被批评窄化能力，并受文化与抽样偏差影响。٣PISA, by the OECD, tests 15-year-olds' reading, math, and science every three years, yet is criticized for narrowing ability and facing cultural and sampling bias.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f1373148fc79�body��社会学研究发现的“邻里效应”相当显著：社区决定了可获得资源的多少——学校质量、公共设施、就业网络、安全感以及同辈榜样。在优质社区长大的孩子更容易接触到对发展有利的信息和关系；在资源匮乏的社区则可能叠加治安、就学和期望的多重劣势，而且这种影响在幼年最强、会长期累积。这正是“机会平等”不仅靠个人努力、还需要改善社区层面的公共服务和住房政策的原因。�,Sociological research finds neighborhood effects are real: communities shape access to resources, including school quality, public facilities, job networks, safety, and peer role models. Children in advantaged neighborhoods meet more opportunity-rich information and ties, while those in deprived areas face stacked disadvantages in safety, schooling, and expectations, with effects strongest in early childhood and cumulative over time. That's why equal opportunity depends not only on individual effort but on community-level services and housing policy.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f276eab1bd18�body���传统管理由人类管理者下达指令、当面监督、依制度考核；算法管理则把派单、定价、路线、评分与奖惩全部交给算法系统，其特点是全天候自动决策、数据高度不对称（平台掌握全部数据而工人只看到片段）、规则不透明且可随时单方更改、以及“分数即惩罚”的软性纪律（差评影响派单）。工人被算法分散为独立节点，缺乏集中的谈判对象，难以集体协商，这是零工劳动者议价能力弱的制度根源。应对方案包括算法透明度义务、评分申诉机制、平台协商代表制度，以及把数据权（可携带、可解释）交还劳动者。�6Traditional management uses human supervisors, face-to-face oversight, and formal appraisal; algorithmic management delegates dispatch, pricing, routing, scoring, and discipline to automated systems whose hallmarks are continuous self-executing decisions, deep data asymmetry (platforms hold everything, workers see fragments), opaque rules changeable unilaterally at any time, and “score as punishment” soft discipline (bad ratings reduce orders). Algorithms atomize workers into independent nodes with no single entity to bargain with, undermining collective negotiation—an institutional root of gig workers' weak bargaining power. Responses include algorithmic transparency duties, rating-appeal mechanisms, platform-level worker representation, and returning data rights (portability, explainability) to workers.�ans��src�٢Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor,《What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy》,Annual Review of Sociology,2020 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857)٠Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor, 'What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy', Annual Review of Sociology, 2020, DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857��id�f298b0b49e81�body���卡斯特认为信息技术使资本、信息与精英得以脱离地方空间，沿全球网络即时流动，形成流动空间；被排除在外的群体则困于地方空间。这重塑了不平等与政治动员的形态。�	Castells argued information technology lets capital, information, and elites detach from locale, flowing instantly along global networks—the space of flows—while excluded groups remain in the space of places. This reshapes inequality and political mobilization.�ans��src��E曼纽尔·卡斯特《网络社会的崛起》(1996, 第二版 2000)�EManuel Castells, The Rise of the Network Society (1996; 2nd ed. 2000)��id�f390fddd34df�body���工厂集中建在城市周边，需要大量劳动力，农民离开土地进城务工，城市人口短期内激增。铁路与蒸汽动力又强化了城市的集聚效应。这造成了住房拥挤、卫生恶化等早期“城市病”。�1Factories clustered around cities and needed large labor forces, so peasants left the land for urban work and city populations surged in a short time. Railways and steam power reinforced the agglomeration effect of cities. This produced early “urban diseases” like crowded housing and poor sanitation.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f58a88c2d639�body�ٙ中央银行发行货币、设定利率、监管银行并应对金融危机，起到稳定物价和金融体系的作用，是经济的“稳定器”。١Central banks issue currency, set interest rates, regulate banks, and respond to crises, stabilizing prices and the financial system as the economy's stabilizer.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f8d1297114ef�body���滞胀指经济停滞（增长缓慢、失业高）与通货膨胀同时出现的反常组合。20世纪70年代的石油危机使许多国家陷入滞胀，使传统货币政策进退两难。��Stagflation is the unusual combination of economic stagnation (slow growth, high unemployment) with inflation. The 1970s oil crises pushed many countries into stagflation, leaving conventional monetary policy in a dilemma.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f9c2507f5bc5�body��结构功能主义是社会学的重要理论视角，认为社会像有机体，各组成部分协同维持整体稳定，代表人物有帕森斯和默顿。它强调制度的功能与社会的均衡。批评者指出它往往低估了冲突与变迁的作用。�.Structural functionalism is a major sociological perspective viewing society as an organism whose parts work together to maintain stability, with figures like Parsons and Merton. It emphasizes the functions of institutions and social equilibrium. Critics note it tends to underplay conflict and change.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f9fad4264b7b�body���斯维德勒认为在稳定时期文化更像一套可调用的话语与技能，人们按情形拼装出行为策略，而非被固定价值观驱动。这使文化解释转向“能力”与“策略”而非“动机”。��Swidler argued that in settled periods culture is a repertoire of symbols and skills people assemble into strategies of action, not fixed values driving conduct. This shifts cultural explanation to 'capabilities' and 'strategies' rather than 'motives'.�ans��src��pSwidler,《Culture in Action: Symbols and Strategies》,American Sociological Review,1986 (DOI: 10.2307/2095521)�nSwidler, 'Culture in Action: Symbols and Strategies', American Sociological Review, 1986, DOI: 10.2307/2095521��id�fb9202754621�body���皮凯蒂在《21 世纪资本论》中指出，当资本收益率 r 持续高于经济增长率 g 时，财富向资本所有者集中，不平等趋升。他据多国历史数据主张遗产资本累积会重塑世袭财富结构。�(In Capital in the Twenty-First Century, Piketty argues that when the rate of return on capital r persistently exceeds economic growth g, wealth concentrates among capital owners and inequality rises. Drawing on long-run data, he contends inherited capital reshapes a patrimonial wealth structure.�ans��src��MPiketty, T. (2014), 《21 世纪资本论》, 哈佛大学出版社 (Belknap)�[Piketty, T. (2014), Capital in the Twenty-First Century, Harvard University Press (Belknap)��id�fc48aed73078�body���涵化指两个不同文化长期接触后，一方或双方的行为、价值观发生变迁的过程，如移民群体吸收主流文化的语言与习惯。它不同于同化——涵化未必放弃原有文化。��Acculturation is the change in one or both groups’ behaviors and values after sustained contact between cultures, such as immigrants adopting the host language. Unlike assimilation, acculturation need not mean abandoning the original culture.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�fc5374e9f3ac�body�ٳAI更可能替代常规性任务而非整体岗位，导致“就业极化”——中端常规岗位收缩、高低技能岗位扩张，并加剧技能溢价与收入不平等。��AI tends to substitute routine tasks rather than whole jobs, producing “job polarization”: middle-skill routine roles shrink while high- and low-skill roles grow, widening skill premiums and inequality.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�fc997537f8aa�body��中世纪伊斯兰世界处在欧亚大陆的十字路口，掌控着利润丰厚的贸易路线，并把财富投入学术。其相对开放、重视翻译的文化保存并发展了希腊、波斯与印度的知识，在数学、医学和光学等领域取得突破。�0The medieval Islamic world sat at the crossroads of Eurasia, controlled lucrative trade routes, and channeled wealth into scholarship. Its relatively open, translation-friendly culture preserved and advanced Greek, Persian and Indian knowledge, yielding breakthroughs in mathematics, medicine and optics.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�fd444d0bb381�body�٥亲属制度是一套规定人们如何认定亲戚、继承财产和分配责任的规则，不同文化有的按父系、有的按母系或双系来计算亲属。ٱKinship systems are rules for recognizing relatives, inheriting property, and assigning duties. Cultures differ in tracing kin through the father's line, mother's line, or both.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ffbb5cd45c24�body���议程设置关乎「关注哪个议题」，框架效应关乎「如何呈现议题」会显著改变受众解读与偏好。恩特曼指出框架通过定义问题、归因因果、道德评价与建议补救四重功能运作。�Agenda-setting concerns which issue gets attention; framing concerns how an issue is presented, which markedly changes interpretation and preference. Entman argues framing works through defining problems, diagnosing causes, making moral judgments and suggesting remedies.�ans��src��mEntman, R. (1993), 《框架：澄清一个断裂范式》, 传播学期刊 (Journal of Communication), 43(4)�bEntman, R. (1993), Framing: Toward Clarification of a Fractured Paradigm, Journal of Communication��id�soc_19_003�body���恩特曼把框架界定为选取所感知现实的一个侧面,借助版面位置、重复频率以及与既有文化图式的勾连,使其在文本中格外醒目。被凸显的信息由此承担四种工作:界定问题、诊断成因、给出道德评价、提示处置办法。他还提醒,文本框架能否生效取决于是否激活了受众脑中兼容的图式,因此同一事件的报道完全可能唤起彼此冲突的理解。��Entman defines framing as selecting some aspect of perceived reality and making it more salient in a text through placement, repetition, and association with culturally familiar symbols. Once highlighted, that material performs four tasks: defining the problem, diagnosing causes, making moral judgments, and suggesting remedies. He cautions that a textual frame works only if it activates compatible schemas in audiences, so accounts of the same event can evoke opposing readings.�ans��src��j罗伯特·恩特曼〈框架化:对一个破碎范式的澄清〉,《传播学刊》第43卷第4期(1993)�oRobert M. Entman, 'Framing: Toward Clarification of a Fractured Paradigm', Journal of Communication 43(4), 1993��id�soc_19_006�body���萨拉蒙归纳出四类失灵:搭车行为令自愿捐赠难以凑足集体物品所需的规模,构成慈善供给不足;捐助者偏好使资源流向特定群体而非最需要者,是为特殊主义;富人掌控善款扭曲优先次序,形成家长作风;依赖业余志愿者则压低了服务质量,即业余性。他据此提出第三方治理模型——政府侧重筹资保障,非营利组织凭贴近需求的弹性负责递送,两者是互补分工而非零和替代。�Salamon catalogued four failures: free riding leaves voluntary giving short of collective-goods demand, or philanthropic insufficiency; donor preferences channel resources toward favored groups over neediest ones, or particularism; wealthy patrons skew priorities, or paternalism; reliance on amateurs depresses service quality, or amateurism. His third-party government model follows: the state secures financing while nonprofits deliver with superior responsiveness, forming complementary specialization instead of zero-sum substitution.�ans��src���莱斯特·萨拉蒙〈公共服务中的伙伴:政府与非营利关系的范围与理论〉,《社会服务评论》第61卷第4期(1987);扩充版见同名文集(约翰斯·霍普金斯大学出版社,1995)��Lester M. Salamon, 'Partners in Public Service: The Scope and Theory of Government-Nonprofit Relations', Social Service Review 61(4), 1987; expanded in Partners in Public Service (Johns Hopkins University Press, 1995)��id�soc_19_009�body���模型将取对数的年龄别死亡率分解为三项:随年龄起伏的基线形态、刻画总体死亡水平逐年改善的公共时间指数,以及把该指数传导到各个年龄组的敏感性系数,时间指数常按随机游走加漂移外推。其软肋在于假定年龄剖面长期稳定,因而难以吸收死因结构转型、队列效应或寿命上限之争引发的形态变化,跨国指数也未必同步演进。即便如此,它仍是各国官方死亡率预测引用最广的统计基准。�`The model splits log age-specific mortality into three terms: an age profile setting baseline levels, a shared temporal index capturing overall improvement year by year, and sensitivity coefficients translating that index onto each age group, with the index commonly projected by random-walk-with-drift. Its weakness lies in assuming a stable age pattern, so it struggles to absorb cause-of-death transitions, cohort effects, or disputes over longevity ceilings, and national indexes need not move in step. It remains nonetheless the most widely cited statistical benchmark in official mortality forecasting.�ans��src��罗纳德·李、劳伦斯·卡特〈美国死亡率的建模与预测〉,《美国统计学会杂志》第87卷第419期(1992)َRonald D. Lee and Lawrence R. Carter, 'Modeling and Forecasting U.S. Mortality', Journal of the American Statistical Association 87(419), 1992��id�soc_19_013�body��[该模型提出命名、归责、主张三重转化:当事人先确认自己受了伤,再把责任归于某一对象,最后才向对方提出补救要求。每一环节都有大批个案流失,真正进入法院者只是纠纷总量的塔尖。追踪这条转化链还揭示,人们对法律的观念决定了他们是否以及何时动用法律。��The model posits triple transformations—naming, blaming, claiming: a person first defines the experience as an injury, next assigns responsibility to someone, and only then presses for a remedy. Massive attrition occurs at every step, so courtroom cases form just the tip of the pyramid of unredressed grievances. Tracing this chain further shows that people's images of law govern whether and when they invoke it.�ans��src�ٟFelstiner、Abel 与 Sarat 合著论文《纠纷的出现与转化:命名、归责与主张》,载《法律与社会评论》第15卷第3/4期合刊(1980–81)ٴWilliam L. F. Felstiner, Richard L. Abel & Austin Sarat, The Emergence and Transformation of Disputes: Naming, Blaming, Claiming..., Law & Society Review, vol. 15, no. 3/4, 1980-81��id�soc_19_016�body��w跨国主义研究显示,当代移民长期维系横跨母国与移居地的多重联系:汇款、返乡探视、远程育儿与祖籍地政治参与同时展开。移民由此栖身于跨越两个国家边界的社会场域,单向融入接收社会不再被视为唯一轨迹。这一转向也推动政策讨论从防止人才流失重新聚焦于人才环流的可能性。��Transnationalist work shows that today's migrants sustain dense ties spanning origin and destination: remittances, return visits, long-distance parenting, and homeland politics unfold together. Migrants come to inhabit social fields stretched across two states, and one-way absorption into the host society loses its status as the sole trajectory. This shift has also redirected policy debates from curbing brain drain toward cultivating potential brain circulation.�ans��src�ٍGlick Schiller、Basch 与 Szanton Blanc 论文《跨国主义:理解移民的新分析框架》,载纽约科学院年鉴 1992 年第 645 卷ٽNina Glick Schiller, Linda Basch & Cristina Szanton Blanc, Transnationalism: A New Analytic Framework for Understanding Migration, Annals of the New York Academy of Sciences, vol. 645, 1992��id�soc_19_019�body��H诺依曼假设人人具备感知舆论气候的准统计感官,并因惧怕孤立而对自认弱势的意见保持缄默。这种选择性沉默令主导意见显得愈发强势,异见愈发稀薄,呈螺旋式加剧。后续批评指出,无畏的中坚分子与匿名化的网络环境都会切断这一螺旋的运转条件。��Noelle-Neumann assumed individuals carry a quasi-statistical sense of the opinion climate and fall silent when they believe themselves in the minority, fearing isolation. Such selective silence magnifies the dominance of majority views and thins out dissent in a self-reinforcing spiral. Later critics answered that fearless hardcore advocates and anonymized online settings can both sever the spiral's operating conditions.�ans��src��@伊丽莎白·诺埃勒-诺依曼《沉默的螺旋:舆论——我们的社会皮肤》,费弗出版社 1980 年德文初版 ; 另见: Elisabeth Noelle-Neumann, Die Schweigespirale: Offentliche Meinung—unsere soziale Haut, Piper Verlag, Munich, 1980 (English: The Spiral of Silence, University of Chicago Press, 1984)�BElisabeth Noelle-Neumann, Die Schweigespirale: Offentliche Meinung—unsere soziale Haut, Piper Verlag, Munich, 1980 (English: The Spiral of Silence, University of Chicago Press, 1984) ; see also: 伊丽莎白·诺埃勒-诺依曼《沉默的螺旋:舆论——我们的社会皮肤》,费弗出版社 1980 年德文初版��id�soc_20_003�body���哈特发现阿克拉的移民并未真正“失业”，而是通过摆摊、搬运、中介、打零工等未被官方登记的活动谋取收入，据此区分了“正规”与“非正规”收入机会。这一概念打破了把城市贫民视为被动剩余人口的图景，表明他们嵌入在真实运作的市场与关系网络中。它也促使学界追问：非正规性究竟是前现代的残留，还是国家规制、执照制度与发展战略共同塑造甚至有意生产的产物。�0Hart found that migrants in Accra were not truly unemployed but earned through unregistered activities—market stalls, porterage, brokerage, casual jobs—and he therefore distinguished formal from informal income opportunities. The concept displaced the image of the urban poor as a passive residual population by showing them embedded in working markets and networks. It also pushed scholars to ask whether informality is a pre-modern residue or something jointly shaped, even deliberately produced, by state regulation, licensing, and development strategy.�ans��src�نKeith Hart, "Informal Income Opportunities and Urban Employment in Ghana", The Journal of Modern African Studies, 1973, 11(1): 61–89فKeith Hart, Informal Income Opportunities and Urban Employment in Ghana, Journal of Modern African Studies 11(1), 1973, pp. 61-89��id�soc_20_006�body���算法通过派单、评分与动态定价把管理权从科层组织转移到系统本身,劳动者名义上可以自由接单,实际上处处受制于不透明的规则。平台刻意维持信息不对称,例如不完全公开计价与派单逻辑,以此削弱劳动者的议价能力并加剧相互竞争。游戏化的等级、奖励与冲单任务则进一步把提高劳动强度转化为劳动者自我剥削的动力。��Algorithms shift managerial authority from bureaucratic organizations into dispatching, rating, and dynamic-pricing systems, so workers who nominally choose their own hours remain governed by opaque rules. Platforms deliberately preserve information asymmetry, for instance by withholding pricing and dispatch logic, to weaken bargaining power and intensify competition. Gamified tiers, bonuses, and order-streak tasks turn higher work intensity into self-driven exploitation.�ans��src���孙萍:《过渡劳动:平台经济下的外卖骑手》,华东师范大学出版社,2024 ; 另见: Alex Rosenblat & Luke Stark, Algorithmic Labor and Information Asymmetries: A Case Study of Uber's Drivers, International Journal of Communication 10, 2016�Alex Rosenblat & Luke Stark, Algorithmic Labor and Information Asymmetries: A Case Study of Uber's Drivers, International Journal of Communication 10, 2016 ; see also: 孙萍:《过渡劳动:平台经济下的外卖骑手》,华东师范大学出版社,2024��id�soc_20_013�body���吉登斯以“纯粹关系”指代仅因双方彼此满足而延续、可随时协商退出的亲密关系,婚姻的核心由制度约束转向情感承诺。贝克夫妇进一步指出,个体化进程让人既追求自我实现又须维系承诺,由此出现“爱的正常混乱”。这一转向抬升了对关系质量的期待,却同时削弱了稳定性,家庭形态随之趋于多样,离婚与再婚同步增多。�Giddens coined the pure relationship to describe intimacy sustained only through each partner's satisfaction and open to negotiated exit, shifting marriage's core from institutional constraint to emotional commitment. Ulrich Beck and Elisabeth Beck-Gernsheim add that individualization pushes people to seek self-realization while holding on to commitments, producing the normal chaos of love. This shift raises expectations for relationship quality yet undercuts stability, diversifying family forms as divorce and remarriage climb together.�ans��src�١Anthony Giddens, The Transformation of Intimacy, Polity Press, 1992年;Ulrich Beck & Elisabeth Beck-Gernsheim, The Normal Chaos of Love, Polity Press, 1995年。ٜAnthony Giddens, The Transformation of Intimacy, Polity Press, 1992; Ulrich Beck and Elisabeth Beck-Gernsheim, The Normal Chaos of Love, Polity Press, 1995.��id�soc_20_016�body��她认为革命成败取决于旧政权的国家机器危机、支配阶级与农民的结构关系以及国际军事竞争压力,而非密谋团体的意志。由此她把国家当作自主的分析单位,追踪三国在旧制度崩溃时刻国家能力与阶级结构的组合差异。这种结构性视角使她的解释区别于以革命者意图为中心的自愿主义叙事。�#She argues that revolutionary outcomes hinge on crises of the old-regime state machinery, the structural ties between dominant classes and the peasantry, and pressures of international military competition, not on the will of conspiratorial groups. Taking the state as an autonomous unit of analysis, she traces how differing combinations of state capacity and class structure shaped the three cases at the moment of breakdown. This structural perspective sets her account apart from voluntarist narratives centered on revolutionaries' intentions.�ans��src���西达·斯考切波:《国家与社会革命》,剑桥大学出版社1979年版;中译本见上海人民出版社2007年 ; 另见: Theda Skocpol, States and Social Revolutions, Cambridge University Press, 1979��Theda Skocpol, States and Social Revolutions, Cambridge University Press, 1979 ; see also: 西达·斯考切波:《国家与社会革命》,剑桥大学出版社1979年版;中译本见上海人民出版社2007年��id�soc_21_003�body���在前现代语境中,身体的形态与能力大多被当作既定事实接受,而晚期现代性则把身体改造成个体可以且不得不持续加工的开放项目。人们通过节食、健身、整容手术等手段重塑外貌,以回应身份认同的反身性建构需求。希林同时提醒,这种看似扩大的选择自由仍受阶级资源与文化规范的深刻约束,并非人人平等可得。��In premodern settings the shape and capacities of the body were largely accepted as given, whereas late modernity reworks the body into an open project that individuals can and must keep refining. People remodel appearance through dieting, fitness regimes, and cosmetic surgery in response to the reflexive demands of identity construction. Shilling stresses that this seemingly expanded freedom stays deeply constrained by class resources and cultural norms, so it is far from equally available to everyone.�ans��src��H克里斯·希林:《身体与社会理论》,Sage出版社1993年首版�QChris Shilling, The Body and Social Theory, Sage Publications, first edition 1993��id�soc_21_006�body���帕森斯在1951年的《疾病的社会功能》一文及其《社会系统》中提出,病人被暂时免除正常社会角色义务,但相应地必须求医并配合治疗以求康复。这一角色的边界由医患互动与社会规范共同划定,不同文化对何为疾病、由谁来照护的规定差别很大。因此疾病的认定与应对深深嵌入职业制度、权力关系和文化期待之中,而非仅由病理决定。�AIn “The Social Function of Morbidity” (1951) and in The Social System, Talcott Parsons argued that being ill temporarily exempts a person from normal role obligations, provided they seek help and cooperate in recovering. The boundaries of this role are drawn jointly by doctor-patient interaction and prevailing norms, and cultures differ widely over what counts as illness and who should provide care. Recognition of and response to disease are thus embedded in professional institutions, power relations, and cultural expectations rather than dictated by pathology alone.�ans��src��A塔尔科特·帕森斯《社会系统》,自由出版社,1951年�4Talcott Parsons, The Social System, Free Press, 1951��id�soc_21_013�body��r现代化理论预期工业化会以共同公民身份稀释族群界线,冲突只是发展阶段的残留物。海克特基于不列颠凯尔特边缘的历史指出,核心区对边缘族群的系统性剥削反而固化族群分工、强化认同并催生分离诉求。分歧因此在于:族群冲突会随现代化自然消解,还是被权力结构持续再生产。��Modernization theory expected industrialization to dilute ethnic boundaries through shared citizenship, treating conflict as a residue of development stages. Drawing on the Celtic fringe of Britain, Hechter showed that systematic exploitation of peripheral groups by the core hardens ethnic divisions of labor, thickens identity, and fuels separatist demands. The dispute is therefore whether ethnic conflict dissolves naturally with modernization or is continually reproduced by power structures.�ans��src�ِ迈克尔·海克特《内部殖民主义:英国民族发展中的凯尔特边缘》(1975);唐纳德·霍罗威茨《冲突中的族群》(1985)ْMichael Hechter, Internal Colonialism: The Celtic Fringe in British National Development (1975); Donald Horowitz, Ethnic Groups in Conflict (1985)��id�soc_21_016�body��h他称之为“集体创伤”:灾难侵蚀的是社会肌理本身,幸存者不再能确信邻里之间仍会守望相助。在其专著《Everything in Its Path》中,他记录了洪水后的居民如何从紧密共同体退化为相互戒备的孤立家庭,并强调这种创伤植根于社会组织与归属感的撕裂,而非单纯的个人心理应激。��He called it “collective trauma”: what the disaster eroded was the social fabric itself, leaving survivors unable to count on their neighbors for mutual aid. In his book Everything in Its Path he documented how residents slid from a close-knit community into wary, isolated households, stressing that this trauma is rooted in torn social organization and belonging rather than in individual psychological stress alone.�ans��src�قKai T. Erikson《Everything in Its Path: Destruction of Community in the Buffalo Creek Flood》(University of Chicago Press, 1976)�Kai T. Erikson, Everything in Its Path: Destruction of Community in the Buffalo Creek Flood (University of Chicago Press, 1976)��id�soc_21_019�body���沙灵强调身体具有两重性:它既是被文化与技术不断塑造的社会对象,又是人们据以行动的物质基础,因此不能还原为纯粹的生物学事实。他把可积累、可转换的身体禀赋称作身体资本——体格、仪态与容貌经由教育、体育和消费实践得到投资,并在劳动力市场上兑换为溢价或惩罚,从而使身体差异沉淀为阶层地位的代际传递。�Shilling emphasized the body’s dual character: it is at once a social object continually shaped by culture and technology and the material basis on which people act, so it cannot be reduced to bare biological fact. He called the accumulable, convertible endowments of the body physical capital—physique, bearing, and looks are invested through education, sport, and consumption and cashed out in labor markets as premiums or penalties, letting bodily differences sediment into the intergenerational transmission of class position.�ans��src��tChris Shilling,《教育身体:身体资本与社会不平等的生产》,《社会学评论》第39卷第4期(1991)فChris Shilling, 'Educating the Body: Physical Capital and the Production of Social Inequalities', Sociological Review 39(4), 1991��id�soc_22_003�body���布洛威对美国一家机械厂十个月的参与观察显示，工人靠超额完成定额的赶工游戏排解流水线的单调，并在同伴中赢得地位。管理层通过计件工资、内部劳动力市场等规则组织这场游戏，把注意力从报酬是否公正转向怎样才能赢。工人在游戏中尝到自主与成就感，于是自愿配合生产，剥削在日常同意中被掩盖并延续。��Based on ten months of participant observation in an American machinery plant, Burawoy showed that workers beat quotas in a game of making out that relieves assembly-line monotony and earns standing among peers. Management organizes the game through rules such as piece rates and internal labor markets, shifting attention from whether pay is fair to how to win. Experiencing autonomy and achievement inside the game, workers cooperate willingly, so exploitation persists masked by everyday consent.�ans��src�٨迈克尔·布洛维：《制造同意——垄断资本主义劳动过程的变迁》，芝加哥大学出版社1979年版；商务印书馆中译本（李荣荣译）فMichael Burawoy, Manufacturing Consent: Changes in the Labor Process under Monopoly Capitalism, University of Chicago Press, 1979��id�soc_22_006�body���西克斯和马茨拉认为，多数越轨者其实早已内化主流道德，因此会在越轨行为发生前用话语技巧暂时“中和”它——这是事前的开脱，而非事后的合理化：否认责任（怪罪环境）、否认伤害（没人受损）、否认受害（对方活该）、谴责谴责者（人人都这样）、诉诸更高忠诚（为同伴义气）。这类自我开脱让越轨与守法形象并存，解释了为何许多越轨是情境性、偶发性而非持续生涯。�jSykes and Matza argued that most delinquents internalize conventional morality long before offending, so they neutralize it in advance with verbal devices—an exculpation made before the act, not a post-hoc rationalization: denial of responsibility (blaming circumstances), denial of injury (no real harm done), denial of the victim (they deserved it), condemnation of the condemners (everybody does it), and appeal to higher loyalties (loyalty to peers). Such self-exculpations let offenders keep a law-abiding self-image, which explains why much deviance is situational and episodic rather than a continuing career.�ans��src�٘乔治·西克斯、戴维·马茨拉：《中立化技术：一种越轨理论》，《美国社会学评论》1957年第22卷第6期，第664–670页ًGresham M. Sykes & David Matza, Techniques of Neutralization: A Theory of Delinquency, American Sociological Review 22(6), 1957, pp.664-670��id�soc_22_009�body���卢卡斯提出，当教育数量扩张、升学机会普及时，优势家庭并不满足于“能上学”，而是转向争夺教育的质量维度——学术轨道、重点课程、名牌科系等更优越的位置。数量不平等刚被压缩，质性优势便接棒维持阶层地位。这解释了为何在教育接近普及的社会里，家庭出身仍然强烈地塑造着最终的学业成就。��Samuel Lucas argued that when schooling expands and enrollment rises everywhere, advantaged families do not settle for access alone; at each transition they compete instead over quality—academic tracks, selective curricula, prestigious fields of study. Once quantitative gaps close, these qualitative advantages continue to maintain their position. The idea explains why social origin still strongly shapes final attainment even in societies where mass education has become nearly universal.�ans��src�٫塞缪尔·卢卡斯：《有效维持的不平等：教育转换、轨道流动与背景效应》，《美国社会学杂志》2001年第106卷第6期，第1642–1690页ٲSamuel R. Lucas, Effectively Maintained Inequality: Education Transitions, Track Mobility, and Social Background Effects, American Journal of Sociology 106(6), 2001, pp.1642-1690��id�soc_22_013�body���在《区分》中，布尔迪厄指出趣味并非纯粹个人偏好，而是习性的表达：早期家庭教养把客观阶层处境内化为持久的感知与评价图式。上层偏爱形式化、“超然”的高雅文化，大众偏爱功能性与即时快感，趣味由此成为划分‘我们’与‘他们’的分类框架。由于这种区分被误认作天赋差异而非社会建构，它便以‘自然品位’之名把等级正当化，完成象征层面的阶级再生产。�JIn Distinction, Bourdieu argues that taste is never pure personal preference but an expression of habitus: early upbringing converts objective class conditions into durable schemes of perception and evaluation. Dominant groups favor formal, distanced highbrow culture while popular classes favor functional, immediate pleasures, so taste becomes a scheme of classification dividing 'us' from 'them.' Because this division is misrecognized as natural aptitude rather than social construction, it legitimizes hierarchy in the name of good taste—class reproduction achieved symbolically.�ans��src�ٚPierre Bourdieu《区分：判断力的社会批判》（La Distinction），巴黎Minuit出版社，1979年；英译本哈佛大学出版社，1984年。٤Pierre Bourdieu, La Distinction: Critique sociale du jugement, Paris: Les Editions de Minuit, 1979; English translation Distinction, Harvard University Press, 1984.��id�soc_22_016�body���李普塞特于1959年提出，富裕社会更易维持民主：经济增长扩大中产阶层，缓和阶级两极对立；教育普及滋养宽容与妥协；有效绩效为政府换来合法性，冲突得以纳入制度轨道。但普沃斯基等人的跨国研究发现，发展对民主的“催生”作用有限，更强的效应是“稳定”：民主一旦确立，便极少在高收入国家崩溃。现代化命题由此从单向因果改为条件性关联。�jLipset argued in 1959 that affluent societies sustain democracy more readily: growth enlarges the middle class and softens class polarization; mass schooling nurtures tolerance and habits of compromise; effective performance earns governments legitimacy, channeling conflict into institutions. Yet Przeworski and colleagues later showed, with worldwide data, that development rarely triggers democratization; its stronger effect is stabilization, since once established democracy almost never collapses in rich countries. The modernization thesis was thus recast from one-way causation into a conditional relationship.�ans��src���Seymour Martin Lipset，“Some Social Requisites of Democracy: Economic Development and Political Legitimacy”，American Political Science Review，1959；Adam Przeworski 等，Democracy and Development，Cambridge University Press，2000。�8Seymour Martin Lipset, "Some Social Requisites of Democracy: Economic Development and Political Legitimacy," American Political Science Review 53(1), 1959; Adam Przeworski et al., Democracy and Development: Political Institutions and Material Well-Being in the World, 1950-1990, Cambridge University Press, 2000.��id�soc_23_003�body���阿里耶斯的历史研究显示，20世纪中叶的西方出现“被禁止的死亡”：临终从家庭迁入医院，由医学接管；哀悼仪式随之萎缩，谈论死亡成为近乎失礼的禁忌。这与个人主义兴起、生命末端的医疗化以及死亡率下降后公众对死亡的陌生有关——死亡不再是社区公开操演的事件，而被隔离为机构内的技术事务，悲伤也被压缩进私人领域。�-Philippe Aries documented how mid-twentieth-century Western societies produced the forbidden death: dying was relocated from the household into hospitals under medical control, mourning rites shrank, and mentioning death came to seem almost indecent. He linked this shift to rising individualism, the medicalization of life's end, and public unfamiliarity with death once mortality fell. Death ceased to be a public event staged by the community, becoming instead a technical matter sequestered inside institutions, while grief was confined to private life.�ans��src�ً菲利普·阿里耶斯：《我们死亡的时刻》，Helen Weaver英译，Alfred A. Knopf出版社1981年版（法文原著1977年）。�iPhilippe Aries, The Hour of Our Death, trans. Helen Weaver, Alfred A. Knopf, 1981 (French original 1977).��id�soc_23_009�body���两人在《寻求刺激》中提出“体育化”概念：十八世纪英国以议会立法压制血腥民俗，公学与俱乐部为球赛、拳赛制定统一章程，暴力受到抑制。与此同时，文明化进程收紧了日常的情绪控制，人们需要安全的宣泄口；体育以“受控的去控制”呈现带有悬念的模拟冲突，让人体面地体验兴奋。因此社会越规范，越需要体育来调节情感生活。�eIn Quest for Excitement the authors coin “sportization”: eighteenth-century Britain curbed bloody folk pastimes by statute, while public schools and clubs drafted uniform codes for ball games and prizefighting, taming violence. Meanwhile, the civilizing process tightened everyday emotional restraint and left people needing a safe outlet; sport supplies a “controlled de-controlling of emotional controls,” staging mimetic contests whose suspense lets participants savor excitement respectably. Hence the more tightly regulated a society becomes, the more it relies on sport to manage collective emotion.�ans��src�ِ诺贝特·埃利亚斯、埃里克·邓宁：《寻求刺激：文明化进程中的体育与闲暇》，牛津：Basil Blackwell 1986年版。�Norbert Elias & Eric Dunning, Quest for Excitement: Sport and Leisure in the Civilizing Process, Oxford: Basil Blackwell, 1986.��id�soc_23_013�body���罗萨将现代性诊断为三种加速的自我强化循环：技术加速缩短运输、通信与生产时间；社会变迁加速令经验与预期迅速失效；生活步调加速造成普遍时间匮乏。三者互为因果——省下的时间被更多任务填满，变迁加快迫使人人提速以免落伍。当加速不再服务目的而自我推进，社会进入动态稳定：人们越跑越快却越发没时间，形成新的时间异化。�hRosa diagnoses modernity as a self-reinforcing cycle of three accelerations: technological acceleration shortens transport, communication, and production times; accelerating social change makes experience and expectations rapidly obsolete; and an accelerated pace of life yields pervasive time scarcity. The three cause one another—time saved is refilled with more tasks, while faster change compels everyone to speed up just to stay in place. When acceleration detaches from goals and propels itself, society enters dynamic stabilization: people run ever faster yet have ever less time, a new temporal alienation.�ans��src���Hartmut Rosa《Beschleunigung. Die Veränderung der Zeitstrukturen in der Moderne》，Suhrkamp，2005；英译本 Social Acceleration: A New Theory of Modernity，Columbia University Press，2013。��Hartmut Rosa, Beschleunigung. Die Veränderung der Zeitstrukturen in der Moderne, Suhrkamp, 2005; English trans. Social Acceleration: A New Theory of Modernity, Columbia University Press, 2013.��id�soc_23_016�body���迈克尔·比林格在《平庸民族主义》中提出：民族认同主要不靠狂热仪式，而靠日常话语里细碎的“插旗”——天气预报里的国界地图、“我们／他们”的措辞、媒体对本国事务的默认聚焦。这些微小符号反复确认民族的在场，使民族成为无须反思的默认参照框架；自认温和者其实每天都在无意间再生产民族主义。�7Michael Billig introduced the term in Banal Nationalism (1995): national identity is sustained less by fervent ceremonies than by small, routine acts of “flagging” embedded in everyday discourse — weather maps bordered by the national territory, the wording of “we” and “they”, news media's default focus on domestic affairs. Such mundane symbols constantly remind audiences of the nation's presence, making the nation an unquestioned frame of reference; people who consider themselves mild and neutral thus reproduce nationalism daily without noticing.�ans��src��fMichael Billig，《Banal Nationalism》（平庸民族主义），伦敦：Sage出版社，1995年。�3Billig, M. (1995). Banal Nationalism. London: Sage.��id�soc_23_019�body���在1965年的医院田野研究中，格拉泽与施特劳斯把医患双方对“病人将死”信息的知晓状态称为觉察情境，区分出封闭、怀疑、相互假装与开放四种类型。情境类型决定谁可谈论死亡、护士如何安排照护、家属怎样沟通。研究由此把临终照护呈现为一套协商而成的互动秩序，成为死亡社会学质性研究的奠基之作。�In hospital fieldwork reported in Awareness of Dying (1965), Barney Glaser and Anselm Strauss called the state of knowledge about approaching death held by patients, families and staff an “awareness context”, distinguishing closed, suspected, mutual pretense and open types. Which context obtains determines who may speak of dying, how nurses organize care and how relatives communicate. The study thus presented end-of-life care as a negotiated interactional order, laying the foundation of qualitative research in the sociology of death.�ans��src��yBarney Glaser & Anselm Strauss，《Awareness of Dying》（临终的觉察），芝加哥：Aldine出版社，1965年。�KGlaser, B. G. & Strauss, A. L. (1965). Awareness of Dying. Chicago: Aldine.��id�soc_26_002�body��因为货币从来不只是抽象购买力，人们还要用它标记具体的社会关系与道德义务。机理：泽利泽研究20世纪初的美国工人家庭，发现他们用信封分装、单独开户等办法把同一种现金改造成多种货币——丈夫的工资归家用，妻子的收入只算贴补，孩子的储蓄轻易动不得；专款专用划清了家庭内部的权威与情感边界，抵挡市场逻辑对亲密生活的侵蚀，预算因而是一种道德秩序而不只是理财手段。�]Money is never bare purchasing power; people deploy it to mark concrete social bonds and moral obligations. Studying working-class American families around 1900, Zelizer documented how envelopes, separate bank accounts, and mental partitions converted one uniform cash into many monies—a husband's wage belonged to the household, a wife's earnings counted only as a supplement, a child's savings were untouchable. Earmarking thus drew lines of authority and affection inside the family and held market logic away from intimate life, making the household budget a moral order rather than mere accounting.�ans��src��V薇薇安娜·泽利泽：《金钱的社会意义》，Basic Books出版社1994年版�BViviana A. Zelizer, The Social Meaning of Money, Basic Books, 1994��id�soc_26_010�body��是集体效能，即邻里间的社会凝聚力与出面维护公共秩序的共同意愿。机理：芝加哥项目测量了343个社区簇的八千多名居民，在统计上控制贫困率、族裔构成与居住流动之后，居民互识互信、愿意干预青少年越轨的社区，凶杀与暴力犯罪率明显更低；成人共同看护街头少年、及时制止涂鸦与骚扰，使轻微失序无从累积成犯罪文化。可见贫困提供诱因，集体效能则决定诱因能否变成罪行。��Collective efficacy: neighbors' social cohesion combined with their willingness to intervene for public order. The Chicago project measured more than eight thousand residents across 343 neighborhood clusters; statistically controlling poverty rates, ethnic composition, and residential turnover, communities where residents knew and trusted one another and stepped in against teenage misbehavior showed markedly lower homicide and violence. Adults watching the streets together and stopping graffiti and harassment early kept minor disorder from snowballing into a criminal culture. Poverty supplies motives; collective efficacy decides whether motives become offenses.�ans��src�ٳ罗伯特·桑普森、斯蒂芬·劳登布什、费利顿·厄尔斯：《邻里与暴力犯罪：集体效能的多层次研究》，《科学》杂志1997年第277卷第5328期٣Robert J. Sampson, Stephen W. Raudenbush & Felton Earls, Neighborhoods and Violent Crime: A Multilevel Study of Collective Efficacy, Science, 1997, vol.277 no.5328��id�soc_26_014�body��标准是去商品化程度，即个人不必依赖在市场上出卖劳动力也能维持体面生活的程度。机理：自由主义体制靠家计审查与低额统一给付，把多数人留在市场内，去商品化最弱；保守主义体制按职业身份缴费给付，福利固化既有市场地位并倚重家庭供养；社会民主体制推行普惠且对标中产标准的给付，社会权利不因退出就业而丧失，去商品化最强。三型背后是工人阶级动员水平与阶级联盟政治的差异。��The criterion is decommodification: how far a person can keep up a decent life without selling labor-power on the market. Liberal regimes rely on means-tests and low flat grants, leaving most people inside the market, and decommodify least. Conservative regimes pay benefits tied to occupational status, cementing existing market positions while leaning on the family for support. Social-democratic regimes grant universal benefits pitched to middle-class standards, so social rights survive exiting employment—decommodification at its strongest. Behind the three types stand different levels of working-class mobilization and different politics of class coalition.�ans��src��p戈斯塔·艾斯平-安德森：《福利资本主义的三个世界》，普林斯顿大学出版社1990年版�`Gøsta Esping-Andersen, The Three Worlds of Welfare Capitalism, Princeton University Press, 1990��id�soc_26_020�body���答案是责备规避的政治：福利扩张造就感恩的受益者，削减则造就愤怒的损失者。机理：花钱是给选民送礼，政客竞相邀功；紧缩却要收回既得利益，而损失带来的痛感远超同额收益的快感，受损者会组织起来惩罚推动者。于是高明的削减总被刻意遮蔽——化整为零、推迟生效、把成本转嫁给未来或非选举机构，令选民无从归罪。这正是福利国家的刚性所在：一经建立便自我巩固。�VBlame-avoidance politics: expanding welfare creates grateful beneficiaries, cutting it creates furious losers. Spending is a gift voters reward, so politicians scramble for credit; retrenchment claws back vested gains, and because losses bite harder than equivalent gains please, the harmed organize to punish whoever moved against them. Clever reformers therefore bury the pain—splitting cuts into fragments, delaying their onset, offloading costs onto the future or non-electoral agencies—so blame finds no address. Therein lies the welfare state's rigidity: once built, it entrenches itself.�ans��src��`保罗·皮尔逊：《福利国家的新政治学》，《世界政治》1996年第48卷第2期�VPaul Pierson, The New Politics of the Welfare State, World Politics, 1996, vol.48 no.2��id�23dc7fc8942e�body�ٮ慕课是大规模在线开放课程，让名校课程免费或低价向全球开放，降低学习门槛。但它完成率低，难以完全替代学历与面对面培养。��A MOOC is a massive open online course bringing elite classes to the world cheaply or free, lowering learning barriers. But completion is low, and it hardly replaces degrees or face-to-face training.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�31c14b902eb1�body�ٺ举证责任指由哪一方提供证据证明主张，通常“谁主张谁举证”以避免空口指控。但在部分侵权案件中，法律会倒置举证以保护法益弱势方。ٽThe burden of proof is who must supply evidence; usually “he who asserts must prove” to avoid bare accusations. But some tort cases reverse it to protect the weaker party’s interests.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�45bf767d42c5�body�ٴ团购把分散的小需求聚成大订单，提高对卖方的议价能力并降低单位流通成本。集采进一步以规模压价，但也可能削弱小商户生存空间。��Group buying pools scattered small demands into big orders, raising bargaining power and lowering per-unit logistics cost. Centralized procurement presses prices via scale, though it may squeeze small sellers.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�46fb2b92aa06�body���弗兰克指出地位商品的价值取决于相对排名而非绝对数量，个体为领先而过度投入（如炫耀性教育开支），形成零和军备竞赛，社会总福利反而下降。��Frank argues the value of positional goods depends on relative rank, not absolute amount, so individuals over-invest (e.g., conspicuous schooling) to get ahead, creating a zero-sum arms race that lowers aggregate welfare.�ans��src��bFrank, R. (1985), 《选择正确的池塘：人类行为与地位追求》, 牛津大学出版社�kFrank, R. (1985), Choosing the Right Pond: Human Behavior and the Quest for Status, Oxford University Press��id�4f2252977961�body��r它批评资本自由流动加剧不平等、削弱主权与环境标准，主张更公平且可问责的治理。ٕIt criticizes free capital flows for widening inequality and weakening sovereignty and environmental rules, demanding fairer, accountable governance.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�52743c9706e7�body��{它认为一旦生育率长期低于更替水平，经济、社会与心理机制会相互强化，使回升更加困难。ُIt argues that once fertility stays below replacement, economic, social, and psychological forces reinforce each other, making recovery harder.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�5b8813fdf9cb�body�ٴ同工同酬指相同或同等价值工作应获相同报酬，旨在消除性别、户籍等歧视。但岗位评估难、议价能力差异与隐性偏见使其执行打折扣。��Equal pay for equal work means same or equivalent work gets same pay, aiming to remove gender, residency, and other discrimination. But hard job evaluation, unequal bargaining, and hidden bias blunt its execution.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�601337985226�body��n欧洲的重商主义民族国家是在诸侯林立、彼此竞争的格局中形成的；而中国自秦以后就是统一的中央集权官僚帝国，海外贸易被纳入朝贡与官营体系，商人地位在儒家秩序中偏低。强大的统一国家不需要靠海外贸易来“建国”，因此没走上欧洲那种以贸易立国的民族国家道路。��Europe's mercantilist nation-states arose among competing princes who used trade to build power; but China, unified under a centralized bureaucratic empire since Qin, folded overseas commerce into its tributary and state-run systems, and merchants ranked low in the Confucian order. A strong unified state had no need to 'found itself' through maritime trade, so it did not follow Europe's trade-based nation-state path.�ans��src���查尔斯·蒂利:《强制、资本和欧洲国家(公元990—1992年)》,上海人民出版社,2007 ; 另见: Charles Tilly, Coercion, Capital, and European States, AD 990–1992, Blackwell, 1990��Charles Tilly, Coercion, Capital, and European States, AD 990–1992, Blackwell, 1990 ; see also: 查尔斯·蒂利:《强制、资本和欧洲国家(公元990—1992年)》,上海人民出版社,2007��id�7505649f1455�body�ٟ因绑定优质公立学位，购房被视为买入学资格，需求被附加价值推高。它折射教育资源分布不均与家长对好学校的竞争。ٻTied to quality public seats, buying such homes is seen as buying admission, pushing demand and price up. It reflects uneven education resources and parental competition for good schools.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7b0351e2e692�body�ل法律实证主义认为法律是主权者的命令、与道德分离；自然法认为法律应符合普世道德，恶法非法。ّPositivism treats law as commands of the sovereign, separate from morality; natural law holds that valid law must meet universal moral standards.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7c6445268bdd�body�ٙ商品货币（如黄金）本身具有内在价值；法定货币的价值来自政府信用与法律强制流通，本身没有固定的内在价值。ٖCommodity money (like gold) has intrinsic value; fiat money's value comes from government trust and legal-tender laws rather than the material itself.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7ec979bbadc9�body��~标签理论认为，被权威贴上“越轨者”标签会改变他人期望与自我认同，反而强化其越轨行为。ىLabeling theory holds that being tagged deviant by authorities reshapes others' expectations and self-identity, reinforcing the behavior.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8687e8e6f238�body��x通过物联网传感器、数据与算法优化交通、能源与治理，但也带来隐私与算法偏见的风险。�rIoT sensors, data, and algorithms optimize mobility, energy, and governance, while raising privacy and bias risks.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�98f87dcf06c0�body�ٺ低层与高层住户利益不一致：高层受益、低层可能受遮光与费用拖累，需全体或多数同意并分摊费用。协调成本与补偿机制缺失常卡住进程。ٽLow-floor and high-floor residents disagree: upper floors gain, lower ones may face shading and cost. Consensus and cost-sharing are needed, and weak compensation mechanisms stall progress.�ans��src��*奥尔森《集体行动的逻辑》(1965)�3Mancur Olson, The Logic of Collective Action (1965)��id�9ee804855c4f�body�ف优质且公平的教育能削弱出身对成就的决定作用，但既有的不平等常通过学区与资源分配被复制。ّQuality equitable education can weaken the grip of birth on achievement, yet inequalities often reproduce through school districts and resources.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�aaad561c2f2f�body�٫业委会代表业主监督物业、管理共有收益与维修基金，是居民自治的关键组织。但它常面临成立难、权责不清与利益冲突等挑战。��The owners’ committee represents residents to oversee property management and shared funds—a key self-governance body. Yet it often faces hard formation, unclear powers, and conflicts of interest.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�babc3134bf55�body�٢抢时效与流量压力下，片面信息先被放大，后续调查才还原全貌，造成“反转”。慢求证、等官方通报能减少被反复打脸。��Under pressure for speed and traffic, one-sided info is amplified first, then later investigation reveals the full story, causing “reversals.” Slow verification and waiting for official notice reduce whiplash.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�dae96300e381�body���仪式之所以延续，是因为它们标记人生转折、凝聚社群归属感，并提供世俗制度难以替代的意义感。即便不信教的人，也常把它们当作文化认同、家族传统或社会黏合剂来保留。�Rituals persist because they mark life transitions, build a sense of community, and supply meaning that secular institutions do not fully replace. Even non-believers keep them as cultural identity, family tradition or social glue rather than purely religious practice.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�db2a4f08cba7�body�ٳ汉语中“4”谐音“死”、“8”谐音“发”，数字被赋予吉祥或忌讳含义，影响选号、房价与车牌。这是语言谐音文化在生活中的延伸。��In Mandarin, “4” sounds like “death” and “8” like “prosper,” so numbers gain lucky or unlucky meaning, affecting number choice, housing, and plate prices. It extends homophone culture into daily life.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�deb54aafb802�body��中心度衡量的是连接数量，而非控制力；一个节点可能很“中心”，却只是信息的过路站，缺乏议价权。真正的权力常属于掌控关键资源、把守要害连接或占据战略结构洞的人，而非单纯连线最多者。�Network centrality measures connectivity, not control; a node can be central yet merely a pass-through with little leverage. Real power often lies with those who control key resources, gatekeep critical links, or occupy strategic structural holes—not simply those with the most ties.�ans��src��OBurt, R. (1992), 《结构洞：竞争的社会结构》, 哈佛大学出版社�`Burt, R. (1992), Structural Holes: The Social Structure of Competition, Harvard University Press��id�f5aa9e0c5741�body�ٙ公交车单人运能远高于私家车，设专用道与信号优先可提升人均通行效率、鼓励公交出行，从而减少道路车辆总数。٬Buses move far more people per vehicle than cars; dedicated lanes and signal priority raise per-capita throughput and encourage transit use, cutting total cars on the road.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f7573ae8cd72�body���在庞大、流动、匿名的社会里，你无法认识大多数人，于是信任被委托给非人格化的制度——合同、法院、认证、货币。正是这些正式机制让与陌生人大规模合作成为可能。�In large, mobile, anonymous societies you cannot know most people personally, so trust is delegated to impersonal institutions—contracts, courts, certifications, money. These formal mechanisms are what make large-scale cooperation with strangers possible.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f9cd9a20e564�body�ٮ传统上子女多随父姓，反映父系宗法；随母姓的讨论体现性别平等与家庭协商意识增强。法律允许子女可随父或母姓，属家庭自主。��Traditionally children take the father’s surname, reflecting patriarchy; debate on maternal surnames shows rising gender equality and family negotiation. Law allows either parent’s surname as a family choice.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�14debd78caba�body�ٺ人口红利指劳动年龄人口占比高、抚养负担轻时，经济增长获额外推力。随着生育率下降与老龄化，红利窗口会关闭，转为“老龄化负担”。٩The dividend is extra growth when the working-age share is high and dependency low. As fertility falls and aging rises, the window closes and turns into an aging burden.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�16d149573b2f�body�٦为遏制跨国企业向低税地转移利润（税基侵蚀），OECD推动15%全球最低企业税，减少“逐底竞争”，但仍面临执行与主权分歧。��To curb profit-shifting to low-tax jurisdictions (BEPS), the OECD pushed a 15% global minimum corporate tax, reducing the “race to the bottom,” though enforcement and sovereignty disputes remain.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�22ea32c991d4�body�پ指1492年后新旧大陆间的生物、作物、人口与疾病的大规模交流：玉米、马铃薯传入旧大陆，天花等传入新大陆。它深刻改变了全球人口与饮食。��After 1492, it was the massive exchange of biota, crops, people, and disease between the Old and New Worlds: maize and potatoes reached the Old World, smallpox the New. It profoundly changed global population and diet.�ans��src��L《The Columbian Exchange》,Macat Library,2017 (DOI: 10.4324/9781912281350)�I'The Columbian Exchange', Macat Library, 2017, DOI: 10.4324/9781912281350��id�2eb7ddbf726c�body�٨它衡量子女教育水平相较父母是上升、持平还是下降，常用代际相关系数表示。系数越低说明教育机会越平等、阶层固化越弱。��It measures whether children’s education rises, stays, or falls versus parents’, often via an intergenerational correlation coefficient. Lower coefficients mean more equal opportunity and weaker class lock-in.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�610043904536�body��l统一的汉字让不同方言、地域的人共享一套文化与历史记忆，形成了“天下”式的文明认同。但古代中国认同的是“文化”而非“民族”——只要接受礼乐教化，便是“华夏”。这种以文明为核心的认同，对应的是王朝/帝国形态，而不是以公民—民族为边界的现代民族国家。��Unified Chinese characters let people across dialects and regions share one culture and historical memory, forming a 'tianxia' (all-under-heaven) civilizational identity. But pre-modern China identified with 'culture' rather than 'ethnic nation'—anyone who accepted its rites and learning was 'Huaxia.' This culture-centered identity corresponded to a dynasty/empire, not a modern nation-state defined by a citizen-nation boundary.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�71234180bced�body���基尼系数衡量一个地区收入分配的不平等程度，由意大利统计学家科拉多·基尼在 1912 年提出。系数为 0 表示收入完全平等（每人相同），为 1 表示收入完全集中在一人手中。�The Gini coefficient measures the inequality of income distribution in a population, introduced by Italian statistician Corrado Gini in 1912. A value of 0 means perfect equality (everyone has the same income) and 1 means perfect inequality (one person has all the income).�ans��src�ـ科拉多·基尼《变化率与集中指数》（Variabilità e Mutabilità, 1912）；世界银行（World Bank）发展指标�XCorrado Gini, “Variabilità e Mutabilità” (1912); World Bank development indicators��id�758ebaf7da07�body�ٱ外部性是一个经济主体的行为对旁观者产生的未补偿影响，如污染。当存在外部性或公共品时，自由市场可能无法达到社会最优结果。ٺAn externality is an uncompensated impact of one actor's behavior on others, like pollution. With externalities or public goods, free markets may fail to reach socially optimal outcomes.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�afce980f52b1�body�ٴ凡勃伦商品（如奢侈品）价格越高需求反而越大，因为高价本身成为身份与地位的象征。它违背了普通商品“价高需求降”的需求定律。پA Veblen good (e.g., luxury items) sees higher demand as its price rises, because the high price itself signals status. It violates the usual law of demand, where higher prices lower demand.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b875f14159e0�body��J合成谬误指认为对个体成立的事对整体也成立的错误推理，例如每个人都储蓄更多在个人层面是谨慎的，但全社会同时增加储蓄会减少总需求、反而降低整体收入（即“节俭悖论”）。凯恩斯在《通论》中突出这一区别，以论证总需求管理的必要性。�JThe fallacy of composition is the error of assuming what is true of a part is true of the whole—for instance, while saving more is prudent for one person, if everyone saves at once aggregate demand falls and total income drops (the “paradox of thrift”). Keynes stressed this distinction to justify managing aggregate demand.�ans��src��U凯恩斯《就业、利息和货币通论》（1936）；萨缪尔森《经济学》�CKeynes, “The General Theory” (1936); Samuelson, “Economics”��id�dcd03621510b�body���15—17世纪欧洲航海拓展了跨洋贸易与殖民，连接了原本隔绝的洲陆，催生世界市场。它也开启了物种、疾病与文化的全球交换（哥伦布大交换）。��In the 15th–17th centuries, European voyages expanded ocean trade and colonization, linking isolated continents and birthing a world market. They also opened global exchange of species, diseases, and cultures (the Columbian Exchange).�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�fc446f8e23d0�body�ٱ名义利率是账面上标明的利率，实际利率要扣除通胀：实际≈名义−通胀。当通胀高于名义利率时，实际利率为负，存款实际在缩水。��Nominal rate is the stated rate; real rate subtracts inflation: real ≈ nominal − inflation. When inflation exceeds the nominal rate, real rate is negative and deposits shrink in real terms.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�fc7619312acb�body�ٺ数据由用户行为产生却由平台采集控制，存在确权困难、外部性强和议价能力不对称等问题，催生数据确权、隐私保护与数据税等政策讨论。��Data is generated by users but captured by platforms, creating ambiguous ownership, strong externalities, and asymmetric bargaining power, prompting debates on data rights, privacy, and data taxes.�ans��src��R世界银行(World Bank)《World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives》�@World Bank, World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives��id�soc_26_004�body��
因为民族是安德森所说的想象的共同体，靠共享媒介而非面对面交往来凝聚。机理：印刷资本主义用方言印行的报纸和小说，让相隔遥远的读者每天在同一时刻阅读相同内容，制造出同时性的体验，陌生人由此能够想象彼此并行的生活；当宗教共同体与王朝走向衰落，方言印刷语言便为新共同体划定边界。想象虽然出于虚构，唤起的归属感却真实而深厚，近代民族主义与国家建构都植根于此。��A nation is what Benedict Anderson named an imagined community, knitted together by shared media rather than face-to-face contact. Print capitalism—newspapers and novels issued in vernacular languages—had far-flung readers consuming identical text at the same time each day, creating an experience of simultaneity through which the parallel lives of unseen others became imaginable. As religious communities and dynasties faded, these vernacular print languages drew the boundaries of the new solidarity. The imagining may be invented, yet the belonging it stirs is deeply real, and modern nationalism and state-building both grow from it.�ans��src��t本尼迪克特·安德森：《想象的共同体：民族主义的起源与散布》，Verso出版社1983年初版�iBenedict Anderson, Imagined Communities: Reflections on the Origin and Spread of Nationalism, Verso, 1983��id�soc_26_008�body���因为近代建国者与匪帮做的是同一门生意：以保护换贡赋。机理：蒂利把统治者的事业拆成相互咬合的四件事——战争制造、国家制造、保护与抽取，君主以御敌之名征兵抽税，再把境内外的暴力威胁当作收取保护费的凭据，与黑帮先纵火后收钱同构；长期战争淘汰弱者，幸存者垄断境内合法暴力并被承认为国家。强制与资本的这种结合，正是欧洲民族国家诞生的隐秘起点。��Because Europe's state-builders ran the same business as gangsters: protection in exchange for tribute. Tilly broke rulers' work into four interlocking activities—war making, state making, protection, and extraction. Princes levied soldiers and taxes in the name of fighting enemies, then treated threats of violence at home and abroad as grounds for protection fees, structurally identical to gangs that torch shops before collecting. Long wars culled the weak, and survivors monopolized legitimate violence within their borders and came to be recognized as states. This fusion of coercion and capital was the hidden starting point of the European nation-state.�ans��src�ِ查尔斯·蒂利：《战争制造与国家制造之为有组织犯罪》，收入《把国家带回中心》，剑桥大学出版社1992年版�~Charles Tilly, War Making and State Making as Organized Crime, in Bringing the State Back In, Cambridge University Press, 1992��id�soc_26_015�body��因为不平等的重心从能否接入转到接入之后的技能与用途之别。机理：哈吉泰伊测量青少年网民后发现，上网时长之外，家庭的教育与文化资源左右着检索、浏览、甄别信息等技能高下，构成第二级鸿沟；范迪克的占有模型再把接入拆成动机、物质、技能、使用四道依次过滤的门槛，社会经济地位沿门槛层层折算为在线获益能力的差距，线上所得又回流线下教育与求职，鸿沟于是换位延续。��Because the center of gravity moved from whether one connects to differences in skill and use after connecting. Measuring teenage users, Hargittai found that beyond time online, family educational and cultural resources govern skills such as searching, browsing, and sifting information—a second-level divide. Van Dijk's appropriation model then splits access itself into four sequential thresholds—motivation, material access, skills, usage—along which socioeconomic status converts stepwise into unequal capacity to profit online, and online gains feed back into offline schooling and job seeking, so the divide persists in a new place.�ans��src��z埃丝特·哈吉泰伊：《二级数字鸿沟：人们在线技能的差异》，First Monday期刊2002年第7卷第4期�tEszter Hargittai, Second-Level Digital Divide: Differences in People's Online Skills, First Monday, 2002, vol.7 no.4��id�soc_26_019�body��因为真正的分野已移到结果端：它衡量的是同样会上网的人在线下兑现收益的差距。机理：范德森与赫尔斯珀发现，接入普及、技能趋同之后，社会经济地位仍在折算为数字红利的落差——优势群体更善于把网络用于增进资本的用途，如检索健康信息、办理电子政务、经营职业网络，弱势者则更多停留于娱乐消遣；线下资源决定谁能把点击兑换成现实收益，互联网由此更像放大既有不平等的杠杆而非均衡器。��Because the decisive cleavage moved to outcomes: this level measures how unequally equally connected users convert going online into real-world gains. Van Deursen and Helsper showed that once access is widespread and skills converge, socioeconomic position still translates into unequal digital dividends—advantaged groups excel at capital-enhancing uses such as finding health information, dealing with e-government, and cultivating professional networks, while disadvantaged users cluster around entertainment. Offline resources decide who turns clicks into tangible benefits, making the internet less a leveler than a lever amplifying existing inequality.�ans��src�ٱ亚历山大·范德森、埃伦·赫尔斯珀：《第三级数字鸿沟：谁从上网中获益最多》，收入《传播与信息技术年刊》，Emerald出版社2015年版ټAlexander J. A. M. van Deursen & Ellen J. Helsper, The Third-Level Digital Divide: Who Benefits Most from Being Online?, in Communication and Information Technologies Annual, Emerald, 2015��id�17ca29ecf683�body���结构洞是两个本不相连群体之间的缺口；占据桥接位置的人能同时获得双方各自没有的信息。这种中介位置带来更早、非冗余的信息，以及对信息流动的控制力。��A structural hole is a gap between two otherwise disconnected groups; whoever bridges it gains access to information from both sides that neither group has. This brokerage position yields earlier, non-redundant information and control over its flow.�ans��src��6Robert Putnam,《Bowling Alone》Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000